<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Luo Translation 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Jongʼad Bura</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jongʼad Bura</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jongʼad Bura</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bura</para>
  <para style="mt1">Jongʼad Bura</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Israel okedo gi Jo-Kanaan modongʼ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1"/>Bangʼ tho Joshua, jo-Israel nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Ere ngʼama biro dhi mokwongo mondo okednwa gi jo-Kanaan?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2"/>Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Dhood Juda ema biro dhi mokwongo; nimar asechiwo pinyno e lwetgi.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3"/>Eka jo-Juda nowachone jo-Simeon mowetegi niya, “Biuru kodwa e gwengʼ mosepogwa, mondo waked gi jo-Kanaan. Wan bende wabiro dhi kodu e maru.” Omiyo jo-Simeon nodhi kodgi.<verse eid="JDG 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4"/>Kane jo-Juda omonjogi, Jehova Nyasaye nochiwo jo-Kanaan kod jo-Perizi e lwetgi kendo neginego ji alufu apar Bezek. <verse eid="JDG 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5"/>Kanyo ema ne giyudoe Adoni-Bezek kendo negikedo kode, mi giloyo jo-Kanaan gi jo-Perizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6"/>Adoni-Bezek noringo mondo oyombgi, to ne gilawe ma gimake kendo gingʼado lith lwetene mathuon kod lith tiendene mathuon.<verse eid="JDG 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7"/>Eka Adoni-Bezek nowacho niya, “Ruodhi piero abiriyo ma lith lwetegi mathuon kod lith tiendegi mathuon osengʼad oko osebedo ka chamo ngʼinjo e bwo mesana. Koro Nyasaye osechula kuom gigo mane atimonegi.” Negikele Jerusalem, kendo notho kanyo.<verse eid="JDG 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8"/>Jo-Juda bende nomonjo Jerusalem kendo ne gikawe. Negimonjo dala maduongʼno gi ligangla kendo gimoko mach kuome.<verse eid="JDG 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9"/>Bangʼ mano, jo-Juda nodhi mondo giked gi jo-Kanaan modak e piny manie got Negev kod tiend gode mantiere yo podho chiengʼ. <verse eid="JDG 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10"/>Negidhi nyime kendo gikedo gi jo-Kanaan modak Hebron (machon ne iluongo ni Kiriath Arba) kendo negiloyo Sheshai, Ahiman kod Talmai.<verse eid="JDG 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11"/>Koa kanyo negisudo nyime kendo gimonjo joma odak Debir (machon ne iluongo ni Kiriath Sefa).<verse eid="JDG 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12"/>To Kaleb nowacho niya, “Anachiw nyara Aksa mondo okendi gi ngʼatno manoked ma kaw Kiriath Sefa.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13"/>Othniel wuod Kenaz, ma owadgi Kaleb matin, noloyo pinyno, omiyo Kaleb nomiye nyare Aksa mondo okendi.<verse eid="JDG 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14"/>Chiengʼ moro achiel kane obiro ir Othniel, nojiwe mondo okwa wuon mare puodho. Kane olor oa e pundane, Kaleb nopenje niya, “En angʼo midwaro ni mondo atimni?”<verse eid="JDG 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15"/>Nodwoko niya, “Timna ngʼwono makende. Nimar isemiya puodho man Negev, miya bende thidhna mar pi.” Omiyo Kaleb nomiye thidhna ma malo kod mamwalo.<verse eid="JDG 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16"/>Nyikwa jo-Keni ma jaduongʼ Musa, nodhi koa e Dala Maduongʼ mar Jeriko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ma bende iluongo ni </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dala Maduongʼ mar Othidhe.</char></note> ka en gi jo-Juda mondo gidag e dier jogo mantiere e thim mar Juda man Negev but Arad.<verse eid="JDG 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17"/>Eka jo-Juda nodhi gi jo-Simeon mowetegi mi gimonjo jo-Kanaan modak Zefath, kendo negiketho dala maduongʼno chuth. Emomiyo noluonge ni Horma.<verse eid="JDG 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18"/>Jo-Juda bende nokawo Gaza, Ashkelon kod Ekron, ka dala maduongʼ moro ka moro nigi gwengʼe.<verse eid="JDG 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19"/>Jehova Nyasaye ne nigi jo-Juda. Negikawo piny gode, to ne ok ginyal riembo joma ne odak e piny pewe, nikech ne gin-gi geche mag chuma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20"/>Kaka Musa ne osesingo, Hebron nomi Kaleb, mane oriembo yawuot Anak adek. <verse eid="JDG 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21"/>Jo-Benjamin, kata kamano, ne ok nyal loyo jo-Jebus, mane odak Jerusalem; nyaka kawuononi jo-Jebus pod odak kanyo gi jo-Benjamin.<verse eid="JDG 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22"/>Koro od Josef nomonjo Bethel, kendo Jehova Nyasaye ne ni kode. <verse eid="JDG 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23"/>Kane gioro ji mondo onon Bethel (machon yande iluongo ni Luz), <verse eid="JDG 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24"/>jonon pinygo noneno ngʼato ka wuok e dala maduongʼ kendo negiwachone niya, “Kinyiswa e yo midonjogo e dala cha to ok wabi yie mondo gimoro otimi.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25"/>Omiyo nonyisogi, kendo neginego ji duto mane ni e dala maduongʼno gi ligangla makmana ngʼat cha gi joge duto ema notony. <verse eid="JDG 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26"/>Eka nodhi e piny jo-Hiti, kama nogeroe dala maduongʼ mi ochake ni Luz, ma mano e nyinge nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JDG 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27"/>To Manase ne ok oriembo jo-Beth Shan kata Tanak kata Dor kata Ibleam kata Megido kod alwora mar kuonde dak-gi, nimar jo-Kanaan noramo ni nyaka gidag e pinyno. <verse eid="JDG 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28"/>Kane jo-Israel osebedo motegno, negiloko jo-Kanaan wasumbinigi kendo ne ok giriembogi kata matin. <verse eid="JDG 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29"/>Kata jo-Efraim bende ne ok oriembo jo-Kanaan modak Gezer, to jo-Kanaan ne odhi nyime gidak e diergi. <verse eid="JDG 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30"/>Jo-Zebulun bende ne ok oriembo jo-Kanaan mane odak Kitron kata Nahahol, mane odongʼ e diergi; to ne gilokogi wasumbinigi. <verse eid="JDG 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31"/>Jo-Asher bende ne ok oriembo joma ne odak Ako, Sidon, Alab, Akzib, Helba, Afek, kod Rehob, <verse eid="JDG 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32"/>kamano jo-Asher nodhi nyime mana gidak gi jo-Kanaan kendo ne ok giriembogi. <verse eid="JDG 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33"/>Jo-Naftali bende ne ok oriembo jogo mane odak Beth Shemesh kod Beth Anath, to negidak e dier jo-Kanaan mane weg pinyno kendo negiloko jogo mane odak Beth Shemesh kod Beth Anath wasumbinigi. <verse eid="JDG 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34"/>Jo-Amor nochoko jo-Dan kamoro achiel e piny gode, mane ok oyienigi mondo gibi mwalo e piny pewe. <verse eid="JDG 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35"/>Kendo jo-Amor noramo ni nyaka gidag e Got Heres, Aijalon kod Shalbim, to ka teko mar od Josef nomedore, gin bende nolokgi wasumbini. <verse eid="JDG 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36"/>Tongʼ mar jo-Amor nochakore Akrabim nyaka Sela kendo mokalo kanyo.<verse eid="JDG 1:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye oor Bokim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1"/>Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nodhi koa Gilgal nyaka Bokim kendo nowacho niya, “Ne agolou e piny Misri mi aterou nyaka e piny mane asingo ni anami kwereu, ka awachonegi ni ok anaketh singruokna kodu, <verse eid="JDG 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2"/>kendo ok unulos winjruok moro gi jopinyni, to unumuk kendegi mag misango. Kata kamano, ok useluora. En angʼo momiyo usetimo ma? <verse eid="JDG 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3"/>Emomiyo koro anyisou ni ok anariembgi oko e nyimu; ginibed kuthe e ringreu kendo nyisechegi nobed tembe ne un.”<verse eid="JDG 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4"/>Kane malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nosewacho wechegi ne jo-Israel duto, ji noywak matek, <verse eid="JDG 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5"/>kendo negiluongo kanyo ni Bokim. Kanyo ne gichiwoe misengini ne Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="JDG 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tamruok winjo wach kod loch</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6"/>Bangʼ ka Joshua nosegolo jo-Israel, negidhi mondo gikaw pinyno, ka ngʼato ka ngʼato yudo pokne. <verse eid="JDG 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7"/>Ji notiyone Jehova Nyasaye e ndalo duto mag ngima Joshua kod jodongo mane osedak higni moloye kendo mane oseneno gigo madongo ma Jehova Nyasaye osetimo ni Israel.<verse eid="JDG 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8"/>Joshua wuod Nun, jatich Jehova Nyasaye, notho ka en ja-higni mia achiel gapar. <verse eid="JDG 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9"/>Kendo ne giike e lope mane opogne mantiere Timnath Sera e piny gode mag Efraim, mantiere yo nyandwat mar Got Gash.<verse eid="JDG 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10"/>Bangʼ ka tiengʼno duto noseyweyo kod kweregi, tiengʼ machielo nochako dongo, mane ok ongʼeyo Jehova Nyasaye kata gima nosetimone jo-Israel. <verse eid="JDG 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11"/>Eka jo-Israel notimo timbe mamono e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kendo gitiyone Baal. <verse eid="JDG 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12"/>Negijwangʼo Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach kweregi, mane ogologi e piny Misri. Negilamo nyiseche mopogore opogore mag ogendini mane odak e pinyno. Negimiyo Jehova Nyasaye mirima, <verse eid="JDG 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13"/>nikech ne gijwangʼe kendo gitiyone Baal kod jo-Ashtoreth. <verse eid="JDG 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14"/>Jehova Nyasaye nobedo gi mirima gi jo-Israel mochiwogi e lwet wasikgi mondo omonjgi. Ne ochiwogi e lwet wasikgi kuonde duto mane ok ginyal tony. <verse eid="JDG 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15"/>Kinde duto mane jo-Israel odhi kedo, lwet Jehova Nyasaye ne kelonegi chandruok, mana kaka ne osekwongʼorenigi, kendo ne gin e chandruok maduongʼ.<verse eid="JDG 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16"/>Eka Jehova Nyasaye nowalo jongʼad bura, mane okonyogi e lwet joma sandogi. <verse eid="JDG 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17"/>Kata kamano ne ok ginyal winjo jongʼad bura mag-gi, to negidhi nyime gitimo timbe dwanyruok kendo lamo nyiseche manono. Piyo piyo nono ne gibaro mi giweyo rito chike mane Jehova Nyasaye omiyo kweregi kendo ne ok gimiye luor. <verse eid="JDG 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18"/>Kinde ka kinde ma Jehova Nyasaye nokelonegi jangʼad bura, nokonyo jangʼad burano kendo noresogi e lwet wasikgi ndalo duto mane jangʼad burano pod ngima; nimar Jehova Nyasaye ne kechogi nikech wasikgi ne thirogi kendo hinyogi malit. <verse eid="JDG 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19"/>To ka jangʼad bura notho, ji noduogo e timbe mangʼeny mag anjawo moloyo kata mago mag kweregi, ka giluwo bangʼ nyiseche mamoko kendo tiyonegi kendo ka gilamogi. Negitamore weyo timbegi mamono kod timbegi mag wich teko.<verse eid="JDG 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20"/>Kuom mano, mirima nomako Jehova Nyasaye gi jo-Israel kendo nowacho niya, “Nikech ogandani osejwangʼo singruok mane aketo gi kweregi kendo ok gisewinja, <verse eid="JDG 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21"/>ok anariemb oganda mane Joshua otho oweyo mondo oa e nyimgi. <verse eid="JDG 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22"/>Anati kodgi kuom temo Israel mondo ane ka ginyalo rito yo Jehova Nyasaye kendo wuothoe yorno kaka kweregi notimo.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23"/>Jehova Nyasaye noyiene ogandago mondo odongʼ, kendo ne ok oriembogi kata chiwogi e lwet Joshua.<verse eid="JDG 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1"/>Magi e oganda mane Jehova Nyasaye oweyo mondo otem jo-Israel duto mane ok osekalo e lweny moro amora e piny Kanaan. <verse eid="JDG 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2"/>Mano notimo mana mondo opuonjgo nyikwa jo-Israel lweny, mago mane onge gi lony e kedo. <verse eid="JDG 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3"/>Ogendinigo ne gin: ruodhi abich mag jo-Filistia, jo-Kanaan duto, jo-Sidon, kod jo-Hivi mane odak e gode mag Lebanon kochakore got Baal Hermon nyaka got Lebo Hamath. <verse eid="JDG 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowegi mondo otemgo jo-Israel kendo ongʼego ka ginyalo rito chike mane omiyo kweregi kokalo kuom Musa.<verse eid="JDG 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5"/>Jo-Israel nodak e kind jo-Kanaan, jo-Hiti, jo-Amor, jo-Perizi, jo-Hivi kod jo-Jebus. <verse eid="JDG 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6"/>Negikendo nyi ogendinigo bangʼe negichiwo nyigi mondo okend gi yawuot pinjego kendo negilamo nyisechegi.<verse eid="JDG 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Othniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7"/>Jo-Israel notimo tim mamono e wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye; ne wigi owil gi Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachgi mi gitiyone Baal kod Ashera. <verse eid="JDG 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8"/>Mirimb Jehova Nyasaye mager nobiro kuom jo-Israel ma nojwangʼogi e lwet jo-Kushan-Rishathaim ruodh Aram-Naharaim, ma jo-Israel nobedo wasumbinigi kuom higni aboro. <verse eid="JDG 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9"/>To kane giywakne Jehova Nyasaye, nochiwonegi jakony, ma en Othniel wuod Kenaz, owadgi Kaleb matin, mane oresogi. <verse eid="JDG 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10"/>Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kuome, mi nobedo jangʼad bura mar jo-Israel kendo negidhi e lweny. Jehova Nyasaye nochiwo Kushan-Rishathaim ruodh Aram e lwet Othniel, mane oloye. <verse eid="JDG 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11"/>Omiyo piny nobedo gi kwe kuom higni piero angʼwen; nyaka Othniel wuod Kenaz notho.<verse eid="JDG 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehud</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12"/>Jo-Israel nochako timo timbe mamono e wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye, kendo nikech timno, Jehova Nyasaye nochiwogi e lwet Eglon ruodh Moab. <verse eid="JDG 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13"/>Eglon kaachiel gi jo-Amon kod jo-Amalek, nobiro momonjo jo-Israel, mi gikawo Dala Maduongʼ mar Jeriko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ma bende iluongo ni </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Dala Maduongʼ mar Othidhe.</char></note> <verse eid="JDG 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14"/>Jo-Israel nobedo e bwo loch Eglon ruodh Moab kuom higni apar gaboro.<verse eid="JDG 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15"/>Jo-Israel nochako oywak ne Jehova Nyasaye mi nomiyogi jakony, Ehud, wuod Gera ja-Benjamin, mane racham. Jo-Israel noore gi chudo ir Eglon ruodh Moab. <verse eid="JDG 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16"/>Ehud nothedho pand ligangla ma dhoge ariyo ma borne dirom fut achiel gi nus, mane oliere e bamne korachwich ei lepe. <verse eid="JDG 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17"/>Ne ochiwo chudo ne Eglon ruodh Moab, mane ngʼat machwe ahinya. <verse eid="JDG 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18"/>Bangʼ ka Ehud nosechiwo chudo, nooro jogo mane okelo chudo mondo odogi. <verse eid="JDG 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19"/>Kane oneno gigo mopa man Gilgal ne olokore en owuon kendo owacho niya, “An kodi gi wach ma lingʼ-lingʼ, yaye ruoth.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 3:19">Ruoth nowacho niya, “Lingʼ thi!” Kendo joge duto mantie noa moweye.<verse eid="JDG 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20"/>Eka Ehud nosudo ire kama nobetie kende e agola ma malo mar ode mar yweyo, mane ojabetie ndalo oro mi owacho niya, “Nyasaye oora iri.” Ka Ruoth noa malo e kome, <verse eid="JDG 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21"/>Ehud norieyo bade koracham, mi owuodho ligangla koa e bamne korachwich kendo ochwoyo ii ruoth. <verse eid="JDG 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22"/>Ligangla nodonjo e iye molal kuno gi loge duto motuch nyaka e dier ngʼeye oko. Ehud ne ok opudho liganglano oko, kendo bor noume. <verse eid="JDG 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23"/>Eka Ehud nowuok gie otuchi manie wi tado; nochiego dhoudi manie agola mamalo mi olorogi.<verse eid="JDG 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24"/>Bangʼ kane osedhi, jotich nobiro kendo oyudo ka dhoudi manie agola mamalo olor. Negiwacho niya, “Nyaka bed ni okonyore e agola ma iye mar ot.” <verse eid="JDG 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25"/>Negirito ma wigi okuot, to kane ok oyawo dhout agola, negikawo kifungu kendo giyawogi. Kanyo negineno ruodhgi koriere e dier ot, kosetho.<verse eid="JDG 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26"/>Kane pod girito, Ehud noluchore mi owuok odhi. Ne okalo machiegni gi gik mopa mi opondo odhi Seira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27"/>Kane ochopo kanyo, nogoyo turumbete e piny gode mag Efraim, kendo jo-Israel nolor kode piny koa e got, ka otelonegi.<verse eid="JDG 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28"/>Nowachonegi niya, “Luwauru, nimar Jehova Nyasaye osechiwo Moab, jasiku, e lwetu.” Omiyo ne giluwe kendo negikawo bath aora Jordan mane ochiko yo Moab, maonge ngʼama ne nyalo pondo mondo okadh aora Jordan. <verse eid="JDG 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29"/>E sechego neginego jo-Moab madirom alufu apar, jogo mongirore kendo maroteke; maonge ngʼama nopondo kata achiel. <verse eid="JDG 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30"/>Chiengʼno Moab nobedo e bwo loch Israel, kendo piny nobedo gi kwe kuom higni piero aboro.<verse eid="JDG 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shamgar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31"/>Bangʼ Ehud, Shamgar wuod Anath nobiro, en ema ne onego jo-Filistia mia auchiel gi bidhi. En bende noreso jo-Israel.<verse eid="JDG 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Debora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1"/>Bangʼ ka Ehud nosetho, jo-Israel nochako otimo tim mamono e wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="JDG 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2"/>Omiyo Jehova Nyasaye nousogi ne Jabin, ruodh Kanaan, ma loch mare neni Hazor. Jatend jolweny mage ne en Sisera, manodak Harosheth Hagoyim. <verse eid="JDG 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3"/>Nikech ne en-gi geche chuma mia ochiko kendo notiyo jo-Israel gachuna kuom higni piero ariyo, ne giywakne Jehova Nyasaye mondo oresgi.<verse eid="JDG 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4"/>Debora, janabi madhako, ma chi Lapidoth, notelo ne jo-Israel e kindeno. <verse eid="JDG 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5"/>Nobedo gi kar ngʼado bura e bwo Yadh Othith mar Debora mantiere kind Rama kod Bethel manie piny gode mar Efraim, kendo jo-Israel ne biro ire kanyo mondo ongʼadnegi bura. <verse eid="JDG 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6"/>Noluongo Barak wuod Abinoam moa Kedesh man Naftali kendo owachone niya, “Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel, chiki ni, ‘Dhiyo, ikaw ji alufu apar mag Naftali kod Zebulun kendo itelnegi ka udhi e Got Tabor. <verse eid="JDG 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7"/>Abiro wuondo Sisera, jatend jolwenj Jabin, kanyakla gi gechene kod ogandage mag lweny nyaka e Aora Kishon kendo achiwe e lweti.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8"/>Barak nowachone niya, “Ka idhi koda, abiro dhi; to ka ok idhi koda, to ok abi dhi.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9"/>Debora nowachone niya, “Mano kare, abiro dhi kodi. To nikech yo ma itimoe gini duongʼ, ok nobed mari, nimar Jehova Nyasaye nochiw Sisera ne dhako.” Omiyo Debora nodhi gi Barak nyaka Kedesh, <verse eid="JDG 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10"/>kama noluonge Zebulun kod Naftali. Ji alufu apar noluwo bangʼe, kendo Debora bende nodhi kode.<verse eid="JDG 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11"/>Koro Heber ja-Keni noseweyo jo-Keni ma nyikwa Hobab, ma en or Musa, kendo oguro hembe machiegni gi yien maduongʼ man Zananim but Kedesh.<verse eid="JDG 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12"/>Kane ginyiso Sisera ni Barak wuod Abinoam nosedhi Got Tabor, <verse eid="JDG 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13"/>Sisera nochoko kanyakla gechene mag chuma mia ochiko kod chwo duto kode, koa Harosheth Hagoyim nyaka e Aora Kishon.<verse eid="JDG 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14"/>Eka Debora nowachone Barak niya, “Dhiyo! Ma e odiechiengʼ ma Jehova Nyasaye osechiwo Sisera e lweti. Donge Jehova Nyasaye osedhi nyimi?” Omiyo Barak nodhi e Got Tabor, kiluwe gi ji alufu apar. <verse eid="JDG 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15"/>Kaka Barak ne sudo machiegni, Jehova Nyasaye nogoyo Sisera, jolweny mage kod gechene gi kihondko kendo Sisera nojwangʼo gache mi oringo gi tiende.<verse eid="JDG 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16"/>To Barak nodhi nyime gi lawo geche kod jolweny ma ochopo Harosheth Hagoyim. Oganda lweny duto mar Sisera noneg gi ligangla; kendo onge ngʼama notony.<verse eid="JDG 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17"/>Kata kamano, Sisera, noringo nyaka e hemb Jael, ma chi Heber ja-Keni, nikech ne nitie osiep e kind Jabin ruodh Hazor kod anywola Heber ja-Keni. <verse eid="JDG 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18"/>Jael nowuok mondo orom gi Sisera kendo owachone niya, “Bi, ruodha, donji. Kik iluor.” Omiyo nodonjo ei hembe, kendo noume.<verse eid="JDG 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19"/>Nowacho niya, “Awinjo riyo. Kiyie to miya pi amodhi.” Noyawo chupa mar chak, momiye omadho, bangʼe oume kendo.<verse eid="JDG 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20"/>Nowachone niya, “Chungʼ e dhood hema. Ka ngʼato obiro kendo openji ni, ‘Bende ngʼato nitiere ka?’ To wachne ni, ‘Ooyo.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21"/>Jael, ma chi Heber, nokawo sigingi mar hema kod nyundo kendo nodhi ire mapiyo kama nindo nogoye ngoga, kendo ool. Nopowo iye gi sigingino nyaka e lowo, mi otho.<verse eid="JDG 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22"/>Barak nobiro kolawo Sisera, kendo Jael nowuok mondo orom kode. Nowachone niya, “Bi, abiro nyisi ngʼat ma imanyo.” Omiyo nodhi kode, kendo kanyo Sisera nonindo gi sigingi kopowo iye kosetho.<verse eid="JDG 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23"/>E odiechiengno Nyasaye nomako Jabin, ruodh Kanaan, e nyim jo-Israel. <verse eid="JDG 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24"/>Chakre e kindeno Israel nobedo motegno mine giloyo Jabin ruodh Kanaan.<verse eid="JDG 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Wend Debora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1"/>Chiengʼno Debora kod Barak wuod Abinoam nowero wendni:<verse eid="JDG 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2"/>“Pakuru Jehova Nyasaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">nikech jotelo mag Israel okawo loch,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">kendo ji giwegi ochiwore mar luwogi!<verse eid="JDG 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3"/>“Winjuru, un ruodhi! Chikuru itu, un jotelo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Abiro pako Jehova Nyasaye ka awerne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">anachuog ne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel wer.<verse eid="JDG 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4"/>“Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, piny noyiengni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">kendo polo nogingore,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">mi koth ochwe kane iwuok Seir e piny Edom.<verse eid="JDG 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5"/>Got Sinai noyiengni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel.<verse eid="JDG 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6"/>“E ndalo mag Shamgar wuod Anath,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">kendo e ndalo Jael,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">yore nojwangʼ, mi jowuoth ne luwo yore matindo.<verse eid="JDG 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7"/>Teko mar jolweny e miech Israel norumo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">manyaka an Debora nabiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">ma abedo ka min ji e piny Israel.<verse eid="JDG 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8"/>Kane giyiero nyiseche manyien,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">lweny nochakore e dhorangeye mag dala maduongʼ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">kata mana okumba kod tongʼ ne ok oyudie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">kind jolwenj jo-Israel alufu piero angʼwen.<verse eid="JDG 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9"/>Opak Jehova Nyasaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">nikech chunya nigi jotend jo-Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">kaachiel gi jogo mochiwore!<verse eid="JDG 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10"/>“Un joma oidho punde marochere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">kobedo e matandiko molos gi ongede,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">kendo un joma wuotho e wangʼ yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">winjuru, <verse eid="JDG 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11"/>dwond joma wer koa kuonde mamon umboe pi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">ka giwero timbe makare mag Jehova Nyasaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">kendo ka gipako timbe makare mag jolweny mage mager man Israel.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">“Bangʼ mano oganda Jehova Nyasaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">nodhi e dhorangeye mag dala maduongʼ.<verse eid="JDG 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12"/>Debora, chiew, chiew!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">‘Chungi kendo ia malo mondo ichak wer!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Aa malo, yaye Barak!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Ter jogo miseloyo e twech, yaye wuod Abinoam.’<verse eid="JDG 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13"/>“Eka jogo mane owe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">nobiro ir ruodhi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:13">oganda Jehova Nyasaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">nobiro ira gi teko duto.<verse eid="JDG 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14"/>Jomoko kuomgi nowuok e gode mag Efraim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">ogandagi nodak Amalek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">kendo joma noa Benjamin noluwo bangʼu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Jotend lweny noa Makir nobiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">kendo joma noa Zebulun notingʼo ludh jatend lweny.<verse eid="JDG 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15"/>Jotend Isakar ne nigi Debora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">adier, Isakar ne nigi Barak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">koreto bangʼe ka gichiko holo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">To e gwenge mag Reuben</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">ne nitiere nono chuny matut.<verse eid="JDG 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16"/>En angʼo momiyo ne usiko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">ka uoyo maj jokwath mondo omi uwinj ka jokwath liyo ni rombe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">To e gwenge mag Reuben</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">ne nitiere nono chuny matut.<verse eid="JDG 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17"/>Gilead nodongʼ loka Jordan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">To angʼo momiyo Dan nogalore but meli?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Asher to nodongʼ e dho nam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">mi gidak e dho wedhe kuma yiedhi gowe.<verse eid="JDG 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18"/>Jo-Zebulun nochiwo ngimagi ne tho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:18">kamano bende Naftali noketo mare e kuonde kedo.<verse eid="JDG 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19"/>“Ruodhi mag Kanaan nobiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">mokedo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">Tanak machiegni gi pige mag Megido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">to ne ok gidhi gi fedha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">kata kawo gimoro amora moyako.<verse eid="JDG 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20"/>Koa e polo, sulwe nokedo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:20">koa kama gichakore negikedo gi Sisera.<verse eid="JDG 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21"/>Aora Kishon noywoyogi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">aora ma hike ngʼeny, aora Kishon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">Dhi nyime, chunya; bed motegno!<verse eid="JDG 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22"/>Bangʼ mano mor mar tiende farese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">nowinji kachikore gi teko mangʼeny.<verse eid="JDG 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23"/>Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nowacho ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">‘Okwongʼ Meroz kaachiel gi joge gi kwongʼ malit,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">nikech ne ok gibiro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">mondo gikony Jehova Nyasaye e lwet joma tek.’<verse eid="JDG 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24"/>“Jael ma chi Heber ja-Keni en dhako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">mogwedhi kuom mon duto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">kendo ogwedhe moloyo mon duto modak e hema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25"/>Nokwayo pi modho, to nomiye chak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">nokelone chak mopwo e bakul moromo ruoth chiemoe.<verse eid="JDG 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26"/>Norieyo lwete mondo okaw sigingi mar hema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">ka lwete korachwich nokawogo twor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">Nogoyo Sisera, motoyo wiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">kendo nopowo lela wangʼe.<verse eid="JDG 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27"/>Nopodho e tiende,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">mogore piny; kendo kanyo ema nothoe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">Adier, nopodho e tiende, mogore piny;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">kendo kama nopodhoeno, ema nogore piny motho.<verse eid="JDG 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28"/>“Min Sisera ne ngʼicho gie dirisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">kaywak kama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Angʼo momiyo gache odeko kapok obiro?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">Angʼo momiyo mor mar gechene ok winjre?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29"/>Achiel kuom jotichne ma nyiri mariek nodwoke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:29">kawuoyo kende kama:<verse eid="JDG 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30"/>‘Donge gipogo gik moyaki ka ngʼato</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">ka ngʼato yudo nyako achiel kata ariyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">kendo imiyo Sisera lewni mabeyo kaachiel gi lewni mabeyo motwangʼ mongʼith,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">monego arwaki?’<verse eid="JDG 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31"/>“Omiyo mad wasikgi duto rum, yaye Jehova Nyasaye!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">To mad joma oheri chal gi chiengʼ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">mawuok gi teko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Bangʼ mano piny Israel nobedo gi kwe kuom higni piero angʼwen.<verse eid="JDG 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Gideon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1"/>Jo-Israel nochako otimo timbe mamono e nyim Jehova Nyasaye, kendo kuom higni abiriyo nochiwogi e lwet jo-Midian. <verse eid="JDG 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2"/>Nikech jo-Midian ne keto ji gi tich matek mar achuna, jo-Israel nogero kuonde pondo e tiend got, rogo kod kuonde moko ma ginyalo dakie. <verse eid="JDG 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3"/>Kinde ka kinde mane jo-Israel opidho cham mag-gi, jo-Midian, jo-Amalek kod jogo moa yo wuok chiengʼ ne monjo piny. <verse eid="JDG 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4"/>Negichokore e pinyno kendo negiketho cham duto nyaka Gaza kendo onge gima ngima kaka rombe kata dhok kata punde mane giweyo e piny Israel. <verse eid="JDG 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5"/>Negibiro gi jambgi kod hembegi machal gi kweth mar dede. Kar kwan jogo kaachiel gi ngamia mag-gi ne tek ngʼeyo, kendo negimonjo pinyno mi gikethe. <verse eid="JDG 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6"/>Jo-Midian nokelone jo-Israel dhier maduongʼ mane giywakne Jehova Nyasaye mondo okonygi.<verse eid="JDG 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7"/>Ka jo-Israel noywak ne Jehova Nyasaye nikech jo-Midian, <verse eid="JDG 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8"/>nooronegi janabi, mane owachonegi niya, “Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel, wacho: Nagolou e piny Misri, kuma ne unie wasumbini. <verse eid="JDG 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9"/>Ne agolou e loch jo-Misri kendo aresou e lwet joma ne sandou. Ne ariembogi gia e nyimu kendo amiyou pinygi. <verse eid="JDG 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10"/>Ne awachonu niya, ‘An Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu; kik ulam nyiseche jo-Amor, makoro udak e pinygi.’ To pod ok udewo winja.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11"/>Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro mobet e tiend yiend ober moro mantiere Ofra mane mar Joash ma ja-Abiezer, kama wuod Gideon ne dinoe ngano mondo kik jo-Midian yude. <verse eid="JDG 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12"/>Ka malaika nofwenyore ne Gideon, nowacho niya, “Jehova Nyasaye ni kodi, in jalweny maratego.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13"/>To Gideon nodwoke niya, “Ruodha, ka Jehova Nyasaye nikodwa, to angʼo momiyo magi duto osetimorenwa? Ere honni duto mane kwerewa onyisowa kagiwacho ni, ‘Donge Jehova Nyasaye ema nogolowa e piny Misri?’ To koro Jehova Nyasaye osejwangʼowa mi oketowa e lwet jo-Midian.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14"/>Jehova Nyasaye nodwoke niya, “Gi teko ma in-go, dhiyo kendo ires jo-Israel e lwet jo-Midian. Donge an ema aori?”<verse eid="JDG 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15"/>Gideon nopenje niya, “To Ruoth, ere kaka anyalo reso jo-Israel? Anywolana ema nyape mogik ei Manase, kendo an ema atin e odwa.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16"/>Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Anabed kodi, kendo ibiro nego jo-Midian duto.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17"/>Gideon nodwoko niya, “Ka koro ayudo ngʼwono e nyim wangʼi, to miya ranyisi ni in ema iwuoyo koda. <verse eid="JDG 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18"/>Kiyie to kik iwuog ka nyaka abi kendo akel misango mara mi achiwe e nyimi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">To Jehova Nyasaye nowacho niya, “Abiro rito nyaka iduogi.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19"/>Gideon nodhi, moyangʼo nyadiel kendo otedo, bangʼe nokawo mogo madirom kilo piero ariyo gariyo mi olosogo makati ma ok oketie thowi koketo ringʼo e adita kod kate e tawo, nokelogi oko kendo ochiwogi ne Jehova Nyasaye e tiend yiend ober.<verse eid="JDG 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20"/>Malaika mar Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Kaw ringʼono kod makati ma ok oketie thowi, ketgi e lwandani, kendo iol kado piny.” Kendo Gideon notimo kamano. <verse eid="JDG 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21"/>Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nomulo ringʼo kod makati ma ok oketie thowi gi wi luth mane otingʼo e lwete. Mach nowuok e lwanda, mowangʼo ringʼo kod makati pep. Kendo malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nolal nono e wangʼe. <verse eid="JDG 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22"/>Kane Gideon ofwenyo ni ne en malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye, nowacho niya, “Yaye, Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto! Aseneno malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye wangʼ gi wangʼ!”<verse eid="JDG 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23"/>To Jehova Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Bed gi kwe! Kik iluor. Ok nitho.”<verse eid="JDG 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24"/>Omiyo Gideon nogero ne Jehova Nyasaye kendo mar misango mi oluongo kanyo ni Jehova Nyasaye en Kwe. Kendono pod ni Ofra kuno e piny jo-Abiezer nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="JDG 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25"/>Otienono Jehova Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Kaw rwath mar ariyo koa e kweth wuonu, ma hike abiriyo. Muk kendo wuonu mar misango ne Baal kendo ingʼad siro mar Ashera man bute. <verse eid="JDG 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26"/>Eka iger kendo mar misango malongʼo ne Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachu ewi kama otingʼore maloni mondo ichiw rwath mar ariyo kaka misango miwangʼo pep, kitiyo gi yiend Ashera mane ingʼado.”<verse eid="JDG 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27"/>Omiyo Gideon nokawo jotijene apar kendo notimo kaka Jehova Nyasaye nowachone. Notimo tijno gotieno ma ok odiechiengʼ nikech noluoro jo-dalagi kod joodgi.<verse eid="JDG 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28"/>Gokinyi ka joma ni e dalano nochiewo, negiyudo ka kar wangʼo misango mar Baal omuki, ka yiend Ashera mane ni bute bende ongʼadi kendo ka rwath mar ariyo ochiw ka misango e kendo mar misango mane oger manyien!<verse eid="JDG 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29"/>Negipenjore kendgi niya, “En ngʼa motimo ma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:29">Kane ginono matut, nowachnegi niya, “Gideon wuod Joash ema osetimo ma.”<verse eid="JDG 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30"/>Jo-dalano nowachone Joash niya, “Gol wuodi oko. Nyaka otho nikech oseketho kendo mar misango mar Baal kendo ongʼado yiend Ashera man bute.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31"/>To Joash nodwoko oganda mager mane ni bute niya, “Un ema uwuoyo e lo Baal? Utemo rese? Ngʼato angʼata mokedone enonege gokinyi! Ka Baal en nyasaye, to onyalo resore kende owuon kuom ngʼama muko kendone mar misango.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32"/>Omiyo odiechiengno negichako Gideon ni Jerub-Baal, kagiwacho niya, “We Baal otiek kode,” nikech nomuko kendo mar misango mar Baal.<verse eid="JDG 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33"/>Koro jo-Midian duto gi jo-Amalek kod jogo moa yo wuok chiengʼ noriwore e lweny ma gingʼado aora Jordan kendo gigo kambi e Holo mar Jezreel. <verse eid="JDG 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34"/>Eka Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kuom Gideon, kendo nogoyo turumbete, kowachoni jo-Abiezer mondo oluw bangʼe. <verse eid="JDG 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35"/>Nooro joote odhi Manase duto, koluongogi mondo gitingʼ gige lweny, kendo gidhi ir Asher, Zebulun kod Naftali, mondo gin bende gidhi girom kode.<verse eid="JDG 6:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36"/>Gideon nowachone Nyasaye niya, “Ka inires jo-Israel kokalo kuoma kaka ne isingo, <verse eid="JDG 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37"/>to abiro keto pien rombo kar dino cham. Kapo ni pien rombono thoo omokoe, to lowo molwore odongʼ kotwo, eka anangʼe ni ibiro reso jo-Israel gi lweta kaka ne iwacho.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38"/>Kendo mano e gima notimore. Gideon nochiewo gokinyi mangʼich; nobiyo pien-no ma thoo owuok madirom bakul achiel.<verse eid="JDG 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39"/>Eka Gideon nowachone Nyasaye niya, “Kik iyi wangʼ koda. We mondo akwayi kwayo achiel makende. Yiena mana tem achiel kende gi pien. E kindeno, pien mondo obed kotwo, to lowo molwore obed gi thoo.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40"/>Otienono Nyasaye notimo kamano. Pien kende ema ne otwo; to lowo duto molwore ne thoo omoke.<verse eid="JDG 6:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Gideon oloyo jo-Midian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1"/>Gokinyi mangʼich, Jerub-Baal (mano en Gideon) kod joge duto nojot e soko mar Harod. Kambi jo-Midian ne nitiere yo nyandwat margi e holo man but got More. <verse eid="JDG 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Gideon niya, “In-gi ji mangʼeny ma ok anyal chiwo jo-Midian e lwetgi. Mondo kik jo-Israel sungrena ni tekogi ema oresogi, <verse eid="JDG 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3"/>go milome ne ji ni, ‘Ngʼato angʼata ma luoro omako ogom kendo oa e Got Gilead.’ ” Omiyo ji alufu piero ariyo gariyo noa, to ji alufu apar nodongʼ.<verse eid="JDG 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4"/>To Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko Gideon niya, “Pod nitie ji mangʼeny ahinya. Kawgi itergi e pi, kendo abiro miyogi penj kuno. Ka awacho ni, ‘Ma biro dhi kodi,’ to obiro dhi; to ka awacho ni, ‘Ma ok bi dhi kodi,’ to ok obi dhi.”<verse eid="JDG 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5"/>Omiyo Gideon noterogi e dho pi. Kanyo Jehova Nyasaye nowachone niya, “Pog jogo magado pi gi lewgi kaka guok kuom jogo magoyo chong-gi piny mondo omodhi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6"/>Ji mia adek nogado pi gi lwetgi. Jogo modongʼ nogoyo chonggi piny mondo gimodhi.<verse eid="JDG 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7"/>Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Gideon niya, “Kuom ji mia adek mane ogado pi gi lwetgi, anaresu kendo achiw jo-Midian e lwetu. We ji mamoko odhi, ka moro ka moro dok dalane.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8"/>Omiyo Gideon nooro jo-Israel mamoko e hembegi, to ji mia adek mane odongʼ-go nokawo chiemo kod turumbete mag joma nodok e miechgi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:8">Kambi jo-Midian ne ni e holo gi mwalo. <verse eid="JDG 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9"/>Otienono Jehova Nyasaye nowachone Gideon niya, “Aa malo, dhiyo imonj kambi, nikech adhi chiwe e lweti. <verse eid="JDG 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10"/>Kiluor mar monjogi, to dhi e kambi gi jatichni Pura <verse eid="JDG 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11"/>kendo ichik iti iwinj gima giwacho. Bangʼe, inibed gi mijingʼo mar monjo kambino.” Omiyo en kod Pura jatichne negidhi machiegni gi kambi. <verse eid="JDG 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12"/>Jo-Midian, jo-Amalek kod jogo moa yo wuok chiengʼ nojot e holo mane oyugno ka kama bonyo ochokore. Ne gin gi ngamia mangʼeny mane ok nyal kwan mana ka kwoyo manie dho nam.<verse eid="JDG 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13"/>Gideon nochopo mana ka ngʼat moro ne nyiso osiepene lek. Ngʼatno ne wachone osiepene niya, “Ne aleko ni makati molos gi mogo mar shairi molworore nobiro e kambi jo-Midian. Nogoyo hema gi teko ma hema olokore kendo olwar piny.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14"/>Osiepne nodwoko niya, “Ma ok en wach moro machielo makmana ligangla mar Gideon wuod Joash, ma ja-Israel. Nyasaye osechiwo jo-Midian kod kambi duto e lwete.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15"/>Ka Gideon nowinjo lekno kod kaka oloke, nopako Nyasaye. Nodok e kambi jo-Israel kendo owacho niya, “Chungʼuru malo! Jehova Nyasaye osechiwo jo-Midian e lwetu.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16"/>Nopogo ji mia adekgo e migepe adek, komiyogi duto turumbete kod njagi maonge gimoro e iye e lwetgi, ka nitiere toch ei njagigo.<verse eid="JDG 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17"/>Nowachonegi niya, Luwauru ka ungʼiyo kendo ka achopo but hema, to timuru mana kaka atimo. <verse eid="JDG 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18"/>Ka agoyo turumbete kaachiel jogo duto ma an-go, eka un joma uselworo kambi bende ugo turumbete ka ukok niya, “Wakedo ni Jehova Nyasaye kod Gideon.”<verse eid="JDG 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19"/>Gideon kod ji mia achiel mane ni kode nochopo e bath kambi chuny otieno, mana bangʼ kane gisewilo jorito. Negigoyo turumbetegi kendo gitoyo agulni mane ni e lwetegi. <verse eid="JDG 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20"/>Kambi adekgi nogoyo turumbete kendo gitoyo njagi. Ka gimako toje gi lwetgi koracham kendo ka gitingʼo turumbete mane onego gi goo gi lwetgi korachwich, ne gikok niya, “Ligangla en mar Jehova Nyasaye kod Gideon!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21"/>E sa ma ngʼato ka ngʼato nokawo kare ka gilworo kambi, jo-Midian duto noringo, kendo negiringo ka giywak.<verse eid="JDG 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22"/>E sa ma turumbete mia adekgo nogoo, Jehova Nyasaye noketo ji duto mane ni e kambi ochako kedo e kindgi giwegi ka ginegore gi ligangla. Jolweny noringo odhi Beth Shitta kochiko Zerera mochopo nyaka e tongʼ mar Abel Mehola man but Tabath. <verse eid="JDG 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23"/>Noluong jo-Israel moa Naftali, Asher kod Manase, kendo negilawo jo-Midian. <verse eid="JDG 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24"/>Gideon nooro joote e piny gode mag Efraim duto, kowacho, “Biuru uked kod jo-Midian kendo udhi nyimgi ma umak pige mag Jordan mochopo nyaka Beth Bara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:24">Omiyo jo-Efraim duto nowuok oko kendo negikawo pige mag Jordan mochopo Beth Bara. <verse eid="JDG 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25"/>Negimako bende jotelo ariyo mag jo-Midian, Oreb kod Zeb. Neginego Oreb e lwanda mar Oreb, kod Zeb e kar biyo divai mar Zeb. Negilawo jo-Midian kendo gikelo wiye Oreb kod Zeb ni Gideon, kama ne entie but aora Jordan.<verse eid="JDG 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Zeba gi Zalmuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1"/>Jo-Efraim nopenjo Gideon niya, “Angʼo ma omiyo isetimonwa kama? Angʼo ma notami luongowa kane idhi kedo gi jo-Midian?” Omiyo negidhawo kode matek.<verse eid="JDG 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2"/>To nodwokogi niya, “Angʼo ma asetimo kipimo gi gima usetimo? Donge mzabibu mag Efraim modongʼ ber moloyo keyo maduongʼ mar mzabibu mar Abiezer? <verse eid="JDG 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3"/>Nyasaye nochiwo Oreb kod Zeb, jotend jo-Midian, e lwetgi. En angʼo mane anyalo timo kipimo gi gima usetimo?” Kuom mano, ich wangʼ margi norumo.<verse eid="JDG 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4"/>Kata obedo ni Gideon gi joge mia adek nool kamano, negimedo lawo ruodhi mag Midian mi gingʼado aora Jordan. <verse eid="JDG 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5"/>Nowachone jo-Sukoth niya, “Miuru joga ma jolweny makati nikech giol, kendo pod alawo Zeba kod Zalmuna, ma gin ruodhi jo-Midian.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6"/>To jotelo mag Sukoth nowacho niya, “Bende usemako Zeba kod Zalmuna? Ere kaka dwami jolweny magi moolgi makati?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7"/>Eka Gideon nodwoko niya, “Nikech gima uwacho, ka Jehova Nyasaye osechiwo Zeba gi Zalmuna e lweta, to abiro yuyo ringreu gi pedo kod matata.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8"/>Noa kanyo kodhi Peniel kendo ochiwonegi kwayo makamano, to negidwoko mana kaka jo-Sukoth nowacho. <verse eid="JDG 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9"/>Omiyo nowachone jo-Peniel niya, “Ka aduogo gi loch, to abiro muko bath ohinga moger motingʼore gi malo.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10"/>Noyudo ka Zeba gi Zalmuna neni Karkor kaachiel gi jolweny mage manyalo romo ji alufu apar gabich, ne gin jolweny mane odongʼ kuom jolweny mag wuok chiengʼ, to jolweny alufu mia achiel gi piero ariyo nonegi e lweny. <verse eid="JDG 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11"/>Gideon nodhi koluwo yo jokwath mantiere yo wuok chiengʼ mar Noba kod Jogbeha mi nodonjo kuom jolweny mamoko apoya. <verse eid="JDG 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12"/>Zeba gi Zalmuna, ma ruodhi ariyo mag Midian, noringo, to nolawogi mi omakogi, kendo makogino nokelo luoro maduongʼ ne jolwenjgi.<verse eid="JDG 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13"/>Bangʼ mano Gideon wuod Joash noduogo koa e lweny koluwo yor Heres. <verse eid="JDG 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14"/>Nomako wuod Sukoth mi openje penjo, kendo wuowino nondikone nying ruodhi piero abiro gabiriyo mag Sukoth. <verse eid="JDG 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15"/>Eka Gideon nobiro mi owachone jo-Sukoth niya, “Eri Zeba gi Zalmuna, mane osemiyo uchaya kuwacho ni, ‘Bende usemako Zeba gi Zalmuna? Ere kaka dwami jolweny magi moolgi makati?’ ” <verse eid="JDG 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16"/>Nokawo jodong dalano mi okawo pedo kod matata mokumogo jo-Sukoth. <verse eid="JDG 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17"/>Bende nomuko kama oger motingʼore gi malo mar Peniel mi onego jo-dalano.<verse eid="JDG 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18"/>Eka nopenjo Zeba kod Zalmuna niya, “Ne inego ji machalo nade Tabor?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Negidwoke niya, “Ji machalo kodi, ma ngʼato ka ngʼato ne nigi kido machalo mar ruoth.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19"/>Gideon nodwoko niya, “Mago ne owetena, yawuot minwa owuon. Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni ka dine ingʼwononegi, to dine ok anegou.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20"/>Eka nonyiso wuode maduongʼ miluongo ni Jetha niya, “Neg-gi!” To Jetha ne ok owuodho liganglane, nikech ne pod en rawera kendo noluor.<verse eid="JDG 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21"/>Zeba gi Zalmuna nowacho niya, “Bi inegwa mana in iwuon nimar in e ngʼat maduongʼ maratego.” Omiyo Gideon nosudo machiegni kodgi monegogi, bangʼe nokawo pien mane ni e ngʼut ngamia mag-gi.<verse eid="JDG 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efod mar Gideon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22"/>Jo-Israel nowachone Gideon niya, “Bed jatendwa, in kaachiel gi wuodi kod nyakwari ma wuowi, nikech iseresowa e lwet jo-Midian.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23"/>To Gideon nokonegi niya, “Ok anabed jatendu, kata wuoda bende ok nobed jatendu. Jehova Nyasaye ema biro bedo jatendu.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24"/>Kendo nowacho niya, “An-gi kwayo achiel, ni ngʼato ka ngʼato kuomu omiya stadi kuom pok mag gik mane uyako.” Ne en kit jo-Ishmael mondo gilier stadi mar dhahabu e itgi.<verse eid="JDG 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25"/>Negidwoko niya, “En morwa mondo wachiwgi.” Omiyo ne gipedho nanga, kendo ngʼato ka ngʼato nodiro stadi koa kuom gik mane giyako e nangano. <verse eid="JDG 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26"/>Pek mar stadi mag dhahabu mane okwayo ne oromo shekel alufu achiel gi mia abiriyo, ka ok okwano bangli, odeyo kod nengni maralik mirwako gi ruodhi mag Midian kata nyoroche mane ni e ngʼut ngamia margi. <verse eid="JDG 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27"/>Gideon noloso kido mar nyasaye manono mar efod gi dhahabu, ma noketo e dalane miluongo ni Ofra. Jo-Israel duto notimo timbe mag dwanyruok e kindgi giwegi ka gilamo kidono kanyo kendo nobedo obadho ni Gideon kod dalane.<verse eid="JDG 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tho mar Gideon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28"/>Kamano e kaka jo-Midian noloo gi jo-Israel kendo ne ok gichako gitugo lweny moro kendo. E kinde ma Gideon ne pod ngima, pinyno nobedo gi kwe kuom higni piero angʼwen.<verse eid="JDG 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29"/>Jerub-Baal wuod Joash nodok dala. <verse eid="JDG 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30"/>Ne en-gi yawuowi piero abiriyo ma mage owuon, nimar ne en-gi mon mangʼeny. <verse eid="JDG 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31"/>Bende ne en gi jatich madhako mane odak Shekem, mane onywolone wuowi miluongo ni Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32"/>Gideon wuod Joash notho ka en-gi higni mathoth kendo noyike e liend wuon mare Joash man Ofra dala jo-Abiezer.<verse eid="JDG 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33"/>Bangʼ ka Gideon nosetho jo-Israel nochako timo timbe dwanyruok kalamo Baal. Negiketo Baal-Berith kaka nyasachgi, <verse eid="JDG 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34"/>kendo ne ok giparo Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachgi, mane oseresogi e lwet jowasikgi duto koni gi koni. <verse eid="JDG 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35"/>Bende negitamore timo ngʼwono ni joka Jerub-Baal (mano en Gideon) kuom gigo mabeyo duto mane osetimonigi.<verse eid="JDG 8:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1"/>Abimelek wuod Jerub-Baal nodhi ir owete gi min-gi man Shekem mowuoyo gi owete gi min-gi kod jo-dhood gi min mare duto, kowachonegi niya, <verse eid="JDG 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2"/>“Penj jo-Shekem duto ni, ‘Ere gima ber: bedo gi yawuot Jerub-Baal piero abiriyo kaka jotendu, koso bedo e bwo loch ngʼato achiel?’ Ngʼeuru malongʼo ni an rembu.”<verse eid="JDG 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3"/>Kane owetene owachone jo-Shekem wechegi duto, to negiramo ni koro nyaka gilu Abimelek, nimar negiwacho niya, “En owadwa.” <verse eid="JDG 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4"/>Negimiye shekel piero abiriyo mag fedha koa e hekalu mar Baal-Berith, mi Abimelek ongʼiewogo jomoko macheje kod jo-mahundu mane oluwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5"/>Nodhi e dala wuon mare man Ofra kendo nonego owetene piero abiriyo, ma gin yawuot Jerub-Baal ewi lwanda achiel. To Jotham, ma wuod Jerub-Baal ma chogo, nopondo motony. <verse eid="JDG 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6"/>Bangʼe jo-Shekem kod Beth Milo nochokore e bath yien maduongʼ mantie ewi Shekem mondo oket Abimelek kaka ruoth.<verse eid="JDG 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7"/>Kane onyis Jotham wachni, nodhi ewi Got Gerizim kendo nokok kowachonegi niya, “Winjauru, un jo-Shekem, mondo omi Nyasaye owinju. <verse eid="JDG 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8"/>Chiengʼ moro achiel yiende nowuok mondo oyier ruodhgi. Negiwachone yadh zeituni ni, ‘Bed ruodhwa.’<verse eid="JDG 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9"/>“To yadh zeituni nodwoko niya, ‘Ere kaka dawe mo miyudo kuom olembena kendo mitiyogo kuom miyo nyiseche kod ji duongʼ mondo abed ruodhu?’<verse eid="JDG 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10"/>“Bangʼ mano, yiende nowachone ngʼowu ni, ‘Bi mondo ibed ruodhwa.’<verse eid="JDG 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11"/>“To ngʼowu nodwoko ni, ‘Ere kaka dawe olembena mabeyo kendo mamit mondo abed ruodh yiende?’<verse eid="JDG 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12"/>“Eka yiende nowachone mzabibu ni, ‘Bi mondo ibed ruodhwa.’<verse eid="JDG 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13"/>“To mzabibu nodwoko ni, ‘Ere kaka dawe divai mara mamiyo nyiseche kod ji mor mondo abed ruodh yiende?’<verse eid="JDG 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14"/>“Mogik yiende duto nowachone kudho ni, ‘Bi mondo ibed ruodhwa.’<verse eid="JDG 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15"/>“Kudho nowachone yiende ni, ‘Ka adiera udwaro keta ruoth, to biuru kendo upond e tipona; ka ok kamano, to we mach owuog oa e kudho kendo owangʼ sida mag Lebanon!’<verse eid="JDG 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16"/>“Ka uparo ni usetimo gima kare kendo mowinjore kuom keto Abimelek ruoth, bende ni usetimo maber ne Jerub-Baal kod joode, kendo usetimone gima romre gi timne, <verse eid="JDG 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17"/>ka uparo kaka wuonwa nokedonu, kochiwo ngimane mondo oresu e lwet jo-Midian; <verse eid="JDG 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18"/>to kawuononi osengʼanyo ni jood wuora, munego yawuote piero abiriyo ewi lwanda achiel, kendo uketo Abimelek, mane wuod jatichne ma nyako mobedo ruoth ewi jo-Shekem nikech en owadu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19"/>Ka uparo ni kawuononi usetimo gima kare kendo mowinjore ni Jerub-Baal kod joode, to mad Abimelek bed mamor kodu kendo un bende ubed mamor kode! <verse eid="JDG 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20"/>To ka ok utimo kamano, to mad mach wuog kuom Abimelek mi wangʼu duto, un jo-Shekem kod Beth Milo, kendo mach mondo owuog kuomu mi owangʼ Abimelek!”<verse eid="JDG 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21"/>Eka Jotham noringo odhi Beer, kendo nodak kanyo nikech noluoro Abimelek owadgi.<verse eid="JDG 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22"/>Kane Abimelek osebedo ruodh Israel kuom higni adek, <verse eid="JDG 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23"/>Nyasaye noketo chuny marach e kind Abimelek kod jo-Shekem mi gidhawo kode kendo gingʼanyone. <verse eid="JDG 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24"/>Nyasaye notimo ma mondo mahundu mane otimne yawuot Jerub-Baal piero abiriyo, kichwero rembgi, mondo ochul ewi Abimelek owadgi kendo ewi jo-Shekem, mane okonye nego owetene. <verse eid="JDG 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25"/>Kuom mano, jo-Shekem noketo ji ewi gode mondo omonje kendo omaa ngʼato angʼata mane okalo machiegni, kendo wachni noterne Abimelek.<verse eid="JDG 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26"/>Koro noyudo ka Gaal wuod Ebed nodar gi owetene odhi Shekem, kendo jopinyno noketo yie margi kuome. <verse eid="JDG 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27"/>Bangʼ kane gisedhi e puothe kendo gipono mzabibu mi gikelogi kuonde bicho, negitimo nyasi e hekalu mar nyasachgi. E sa mane gichiemo kendo metho, ne gikwongʼo Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28"/>Eka Gaal wuod Ebed nowacho niya, “Abimelek to en ngʼa, kendo Shekem bende en ngʼa, manyaka wabed e bwo lochne? Donge en wuod Jerub-Baal, to jalupne donge en Zebul? Tiuru ne jo-Hamor, ma wuon Shekem! Koro ere gima omiyo dwatine Abimelek? <verse eid="JDG 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29"/>Ka dine gibed e bwo lochna, to dine atieke, kendo dine awachone Abimelek ni, ‘Kel jolwenji duto mondo akedgo!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30"/>Kane Zebul ma jatend dala maduongʼno nowinjo gima Gaal wuod Ebed owacho, iye nowangʼ ahinya. <verse eid="JDG 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31"/>Nooro joote ir Abimelek, mowacho niya, “Gaal wuod Ebed kod owetena osebiro Shekem kendo gidwaro mondo dala maduongʼ omonji. <verse eid="JDG 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32"/>Omiyo koro kaw jogi gotieno mondo upond e bungu kuritogi. <verse eid="JDG 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33"/>Ka chiengʼ wuok gokinyi, to suduru machiegni gi dala maduongʼ, mondo ka Gaal gi joge wuok e dala maduongʼ mondo omonju, to timnegiuru gimoro amora ma unyalo timo.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34"/>Omiyo Abimelek kod jolweny mage duto nowuok gotieno, ne gipogore e migepe angʼwen mi gibuto mondo gimonj Shekem. <verse eid="JDG 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35"/>Koro Gaal wuod Ebed nowuok oko kendo negichungʼ e dhoranga dala maduongʼ mana sa ma Abimelek gi jolweny mage nowuok e kuondegi mane giponde.<verse eid="JDG 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36"/>Kane Gaal onenogi, nowachone Zebul niya, “Ne joma biro koa ewi gode!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zebul nodwoko niya, “Tipo mag gode ema bwogi ni ji.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37"/>To Gaal nowachone kendo niya, “Ne joma biro koa e dier piny, kendo oganda maduongʼ biro koa yo koma opidhie yadh ajwoga.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38"/>Eka Zebul nowachone niya, “Ere thoro wach maru koro, un mane uwacho ni, ‘Abimelek en ngʼa manyaka wabed mana e bwo lochne?’ Donge magi e joma ne ichayo? Koro wuoguru mondo uked kodgi!”<verse eid="JDG 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39"/>Omiyo Gaal notelo ne jo-Shekem kendo mi gikedo gi Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40"/>Abimelek nolawe, kendo ji mane ohinyore kanyo ne ngʼeny mochopo nyaka e dhorangach. <verse eid="JDG 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41"/>Abimelek nodongʼ Aruma, kendo Zebul noriembo Gaal kod owetene oko mar Shekem.<verse eid="JDG 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42"/>Kinyne jo-Shekem nowuok oko kama oyangore kendo ne gikone Abimelek wachni. <verse eid="JDG 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43"/>Omiyo nogolo joge, mi opogogi e migepe adek kendo nochako kedo kodgi. Kane oneno ji ka wuok e dala maduongʼ, ne owuok mondo oked kodgi. <verse eid="JDG 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44"/>Abimelek kod kanyakla mane ni kode noreto kochiko kamoro e dhoranga dala maduongʼ. Eka migepe ariyo noreto odhi ir ji duto mane ni e pewe mine ginegogi duto. <verse eid="JDG 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45"/>Odiechiengno duto Abimelek nokedo matek gi dala maduongʼ manyaka okawe kendo onego joma nodak e iye. Eka noketho dalano kendo nokworo chumbi kuome duto.<verse eid="JDG 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46"/>Kane ji owinjo wachno, joma nodak kama oger motingʼore gi malo mar Shekem nodhi kama oger motegno mar hekalu mar El-Berith. <verse eid="JDG 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47"/>Kane Abimelek owinjo nine gisechokore kanyo, <verse eid="JDG 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48"/>en kaachiel gi joge duto negidhi e Got Zalmon. Abimelek nokawo le mi otongʼogo bad yath moro, mi notingʼe e goke. Nochiwo chik ne joma nenikode niya, “Uneno gima atimoni! Timuru kamano piyo!” <verse eid="JDG 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49"/>Omiyo jogo duto notongʼo bede yath mi giluwo bangʼ Abimelek. Negichano yiendego e kor ot mar hekaluno gi oko eka ne gimoko mach kuom ji ei dalano. Omiyo ji duto mane nitiere kama oger motingʼore gi malo mar Shekem notho, chwo kod mon madirom ji alufu achiel.<verse eid="JDG 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50"/>Bangʼ mano, Abimelek nodhi Thebez mine olwore kendo omonje. <verse eid="JDG 9:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51"/>Kata kamano, ei dala maduongʼno, ne nitie kama oger motegno motingʼore gi malo, kendo ji duto, chwo gi mon nodhi mopondo kanyo. Ne gilorore e iye mi giidho ewi kama oger motegnono. <verse eid="JDG 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52"/>Abimelek nodhi e kama oger motegnono mondo omi omonje. To kane ochopo machiegni gi dhoranga kama oger motegnono mondo omokie mach, <verse eid="JDG 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53"/>to dhako moro nolwaro kidi maduongʼ mar nyapongʼ ewi Abimelek mi obarore.<verse eid="JDG 9:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54"/>Noluongo jatingʼne gik lweny mapiyo mowachone niya, “Wuodh liganglani kendo inega, mondo kik giwach ni, ‘Dhako ema nonege.’ ” Omiyo jatichne nowuodho ligangla mochwowego kendo otho. <verse eid="JDG 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55"/>Kane jo-Israel oneno ka Abimelek otho, ne giwuok mi gidok e miechgi.<verse eid="JDG 9:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56"/>Omiyo Nyasaye nokumo Abimelek kuom timbe mamono mane otimo ne wuon mare kuom nego owetene piero abiriyo. <verse eid="JDG 9:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57"/>Nyasaye nokumo bende jo-Shekem kuom timbegi mamono. Kwongʼ mane Jotham wuod Jerub-Baal okwongʼogigo nochopo kare.<verse eid="JDG 9:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1"/>Bangʼ loch Abimelek ja-Isakar, Tola wuod Pua, ma wuod Dodo, nowuok mondo ores jo-Israel. Nodak Shamir, e piny got mar Efraim. <verse eid="JDG 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2"/>Notelo ne Israel kuom higni piero ariyo gadek; eka notho, kendo noyike Shamir.<verse eid="JDG 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jair</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3"/>Noluwe gi Jair ma ja-Gilead, ma notelo ne Israel kuom higni piero ariyo gariyo. <verse eid="JDG 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4"/>Ne en-gi yawuowi piero adek mane nigi punde piero adek mane giidho. Negitelone mier piero adek man Gilead, manyaka kawuononi pod iluongo ni Havoth Jair. <verse eid="JDG 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5"/>Ka Jair notho, noyike Kamon.<verse eid="JDG 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jeftha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6"/>Jo-Israel nochako otimo timbe mamono e wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye. Negitiyone Baal gi Ashtoreth, kod nyiseche mag jo-Aram, gi nyiseche mag jo-Sidon, nyiseche mag jo-Moab, nyiseche mag jo-Amon kod nyiseche mag jo-Filistia. Bende nikech jo-Israel nojwangʼo Jehova Nyasaye mi ok gitiyone, <verse eid="JDG 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7"/>iye nowangʼ kodgi. Nochiwogi e lwet jo-Filistia kod jo-Amon, <verse eid="JDG 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8"/>mane osandogi kendo othirogi e higano. Kuom higni apar gaboro negisando jo-Israel duto mane nitie yo wuok chiengʼ mar Jordan e piny Gilead, ma en piny jo-Amor. <verse eid="JDG 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9"/>Jo-Amon bende nongʼado Jordan mondo oked gi jo-Juda, jo-Benjamin kod od Efraim; kendo Israel nenie thagruok malich. <verse eid="JDG 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10"/>Eka jo-Israel noywak ne Jehova Nyasaye, “Waseketho e nyimi, ka waweyo Nyasachwa kendo watiyone nyiseche mag Baal.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11"/>Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “E kinde mane jo-Misri, jo-Amor, jo-Amon, jo-Filistia, <verse eid="JDG 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12"/>jo-Sidon, jo-Amalek kod jo-Maon nothirou kendo ne uywakna mondo akonyu, donge ne aresou ma ua e lwetgi? <verse eid="JDG 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13"/>To usejwangʼa mutiyone nyiseche mamoko, omiyo koro ok anachak aresu. <verse eid="JDG 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14"/>Dhiuru kendo uywagne nyisecheu ma useyiero. Weuru giresu sa ma un e thagruok!”<verse eid="JDG 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15"/>To jo-Israel nowachone Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Wasetimo richo. Timnwa gimoro amora miparo ni berni, to kiyie to reswa sani.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16"/>Eka ne giwito nyiseche manono kendo negitiyo ni Jehova Nyasaye. Eka Jehova Nyasaye nokecho jo-Israel kuom thagruokgi.<verse eid="JDG 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17"/>Ka jo-Amon noluongi mondo oik gige lweny mag-gi kendo gichokre Gilead, jo-Israel to nochokore Mizpa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18"/>Jotend jo-Gilead nowacho kendgi giwegi niya, “Ngʼato angʼata ma nemonj jo-Amon ema nobed jotend jogo duto modak Gilead.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1"/>Jeftha ja-Gilead ne jalweny mager. Wuon mare ne en Gilead, to min mare ne en ochot. <verse eid="JDG 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2"/>Chi Gilead mahie bende nonywolone yawuowi, kendo kane gisebedo madongo, ne giriembo Jeftha. Negiwachone niya, “Ok iniyud girkeni moro amora e dalawa ka, nikech in wuod dhako machielo.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3"/>Omiyo Jeftha noringo moa ir owetene kendo nodhi odak e piny Tob, kama jodwar mangʼeny nochokore bute mi giluwe.<verse eid="JDG 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4"/>Bangʼe, ka jo-Amon nochako lweny gi jo-Israel, <verse eid="JDG 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5"/>jodong Gilead nodhi mondo ogol Jeftha e piny Tob. <verse eid="JDG 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6"/>Negiwachone niya, “Bi mondo ibed jatendwa mar lweny, mondo mi waked gi jo-Amon.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7"/>Jeftha nowachonegi niya, “Donge ne ok udwara mi uriembo e od wuora? En angʼo momiyo koro ubiro ira, ka un e thagruok?”<verse eid="JDG 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8"/>Jodong Gilead nodwoke niya, “Kata kamano, wabiro iri koro; bi kodwa mondo waked gi jo-Amon, kendo inibed jatendwa kaachiel gi jogo duto modak Gilead.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9"/>Jeftha nodwoko niya, “Ka dipo ni udwoka mondo aked gi jo-Amon kendo Jehova Nyasaye omiyagi; bende anabed jatendu adier?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10"/>Jodong Gilead nodwoko niya, “Jehova Nyasaye obed janeno marwa; adier wabiro timo kaka iwachono.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11"/>Omiyo Jeftha nodhi gi jodong Gilead, kendo ji nokete obedo jatelo kendo jatend lweny. Kendo nonwoyo wechegi duto e nyim Jehova Nyasaye kama iluongo ni Mizpa.<verse eid="JDG 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12"/>Bangʼe Jeftha nooro joote ir ruodh jo-Amon kapenje niya, “En angʼo milaro kodwa, momiyo idwaro kedo kodwa?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13"/>Ruodh jo-Amon nodwoko joote Jeftha niya, “Kane jo-Israel owuok Misri, negikawo pinya chakre aora Arnon nyaka aora Jabok mi gichopo nyaka aora Jordan, koro duognago gi kwe.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14"/>Jeftha nooro joote mondo odog ir ruodh jo-Amon, <verse eid="JDG 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15"/>kawacho niya,</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JDG 11:15">“Ma e gima Jeftha wacho: Jo-Israel ne ok okawo piny jo-Moab kata piny jo-Amon. <verse eid="JDG 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16"/>To kane gia Misri, jo-Israel noluwo thim nyaka Nam Makwar kendo ma gichopo Kadesh. <verse eid="JDG 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17"/>Eka jo-Israel nooro joote ir ruodh jo-Edom, kawacho niya, ‘Miya thuolo mondo wakal e pinyu,’ to ruodh Edom ne ok nyal winjogi. Nochako ooro joote ir ruodh Moab, to en bende nodagi. Kuom mano jo-Israel nodak Kadesh.<verse eid="JDG 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18"/>“Bangʼe negiwuotho e thim, ka ginono pinje mag Edom gi Moab, ka gikalo yo wuok chiengʼ mar piny Moab mine gidhi gibworo e bath aora Arnon. Ne ok gidonjo e alap mar jo-Moab, nimar Arnon ema tongʼ mare.<verse eid="JDG 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19"/>“Bangʼe Jakobo nooro joote ir Sihon ruodh jo-Amor mane ruoth Heshbon, kendo mi nowachone ni, ‘Yie iwewa wakalie pinyu wadhi e karwa owuon.’ <verse eid="JDG 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20"/>Kata kamano, Sihon ne ok nigi adiera gi jo-Israel mondo gikal e pinye. Nochoko joge duto kendo mi gichokore Jahaz mondo giked gi jo-Israel.<verse eid="JDG 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21"/>“Eka Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, nochiwo Sihon kod joge duto e lwet jo-Israel, kendo negiloyogi. Jo-Israel nokawo puothe jo-Amor mane odak e pinyno, <verse eid="JDG 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22"/>ka gikawe duto chakre e aora Arnon nyaka e aora Jabok kendo koa e thim nyaka e aora Jordan.<verse eid="JDG 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23"/>“Ka koro Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, oseriembo jo-Amor e nyim joge Israel, en thuolo mane ma in-go mar kawe? <verse eid="JDG 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24"/>Donge ubiro mana kawo gima Kemosh ma nyasachu omiyou? Kamano bende, gimoro amora ma Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa omiyowa, wabiro kawo. <verse eid="JDG 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25"/>Iparo ni ilich maloyo Balak wuod Zipor, ma ruodh Moab? Bende nodhawo gi Israel kata kedo kodgi? <verse eid="JDG 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26"/>Kuom higni mia adek Israel nodak Heshbon, gi Aroer, gi alwora mar kuondego kod mier duto mokiewo gi aora Arnon. En angʼo ma nomonou kawogi e hignigo? <verse eid="JDG 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27"/>Wan pok wakethonu, to un koro utimonwa marach kuom kedo kodwa. Mad uwe Jehova Nyasaye, ma jangʼad bura ongʼad burano odiechiengʼ ma kawuononi e kind jo-Israel gi jo-Amon.”<verse eid="JDG 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28"/>Kata kamano, ruodh jo-Amon ne ok odewo ote mane joote Jeftha okelone.<verse eid="JDG 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29"/>Eka Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kuom Jeftha. Noluwo piny Gilead gi Manase, kokalo Mizpa mar Gilead, kendo koa kanyo nodhi momonjo jo-Amon. <verse eid="JDG 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30"/>Kendo Jeftha nokwongʼore ne Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Ka inichiw jo-Amon e lweta, <verse eid="JDG 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31"/>to ngʼato angʼata mani wuog e dalana mondo orom koda bangʼ ka aseloyo jo-Amon nobed mar Jehova Nyasaye, kendo anachiwe kaka misango miwangʼo pep.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32"/>Eka Jeftha nowuok mondo odhi oked gi jo-Amon, kendo Jehova Nyasaye nochiwogi e lwete. <verse eid="JDG 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33"/>Noketho mier piero ariyo kochakore e aora Aroer nyaka Minith, mochopo nyaka Abel Keramim. Mano e kaka jo-Israel nokawo Amon.<verse eid="JDG 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34"/>Kane Jeftha odwogo dalane man Mizpa, noneno mana nyare kamiel kabiro romone! Ne en gi nyako achiel kende maonge wuowi kata nyako moro machielo. <verse eid="JDG 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35"/>Kane onene, noyiecho lepe mi oywak niya, “Yaye Nyara! Isemiya abedo modhier kendo gi thagruok, nikech ne asesingora ne Jehova Nyasaye ma ok anyal ketho.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36"/>Nodwoko niya, “Wuonwa, isechiwo wachni ne Jehova Nyasaye. Timna mana kaka ne isesingori, nikech Jehova Nyasaye koro oseresi e lwet wasiki, ma jo-Amon.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37"/>Nomedo wachone niya, “To yie itimna kwayo achiel kende. Miya dweche ariyo mondo aba ewi gode kendo aywagi gi osiepena, nikech ok bi kenda.”<verse eid="JDG 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38"/>Nowachone niya, “Inyalo dhi.” Eka noweye modhi kuom dweche ariyo. En kaachiel gi nyiri mamoko nodhi ewi gode kendo ne giywak nikech ok bi kende. <verse eid="JDG 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39"/>Bangʼ dweche ariyo, nodok ir wuon mare kendo wuon-gi notimo mana kaka nosesingore. Ne en nyako ngili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Kochakore e ndalono, jo-Israel noketo chik ni <verse eid="JDG 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40"/>higa ka higa mon matindo mag Israel nyaka dhi e got kuom ndalo angʼwen mondo otim rapar mar nyar Jeftha ma ja-Gilead.<verse eid="JDG 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Jeftha gi Efraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1"/>Jo-Efraim nochoko jolweny mage, ma gidhi Zafon kendo giwachone Jeftha niya, “Angʼo ma omiyo ne idhi kedo gi jo-Amon ma ok iluongowa mondo wadhi kodi? Wadhi wangʼo odi ka in e iye.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2"/>Jeftha nodwoko niya, An kod joga ne wanie kedo mager gi jo-Amon, ne waluongou to ne utamoru biro resowa e lwetgi. <verse eid="JDG 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3"/>Kane aneno ni ok unyal konya, nakawo ngimana e lweta mi angʼado adhi mondo aked gi jo-Amon, kendo Jehova Nyasaye nomiya loch kuomgi. Koro, angʼoma omiyo ubiro kawuono mondo uked koda?<verse eid="JDG 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4"/>Omiyo Jeftha noluongo jo-Gilead duto mi gikedo gi jo-Efraim. Jo-Gilead nonegogi nikech jo-Efraim nosewacho niya, “Un jo-Gilead un mana jonjore mane oa Efraim gi Manase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5"/>Jo-Gilead nomako kuonde miyorogo Jordan mondo jo-Efraim kik ngʼadi. Sa moro amora mane ja-Efraim dwaro ngʼado kanyo to ne okwayo ni yiene okadhi odhi loka cha. To kane okwayo kamano; to ja-Gilead ne penje ka bende en ja-Efraim. To kane odwoko ni ok en ja-Efraim, <verse eid="JDG 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6"/>to negiwachone ni mondo owach ni Shiboleth. To kane ok onyal luongo wachno maber, mi oluonge mana ni Siboleth, to negimake mi ginege e dho wath miyorogo aora Jordan. Jo-Efraim alufu piero angʼwen gariyo nonegi odiechiengno.<verse eid="JDG 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7"/>Jeftha notelo ne jo-Israel kuom higni auchiel. Bangʼe Jeftha ma ja-Gilead notho, mi noyike e dalane man Gilead.<verse eid="JDG 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibzan, Elon kod Abdon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8"/>Bangʼ Jeftha, Ibzan ja-Bethlehem notelo ne jo-Israel. <verse eid="JDG 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9"/>Ne en-gi yawuowi piero adek kod nyiri piero adek. Nochiwo nyige monywom gi joma oko ma ok anywolane, to ne yawuote nokelonegi mon matindo obedo mondegi koa oko mar anywolane. Ibzan notelo ne Israel kuom higni abiriyo. <verse eid="JDG 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10"/>Bangʼe Ibzan notho, kendo noyike Bethlehem.<verse eid="JDG 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11"/>Bangʼ Ibzan, Elon ja-Zebulun notelo ne Israel kuom higni apar. <verse eid="JDG 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12"/>Eka Elon notho, kendo noyike Aijalon mantiere e piny Zebulun.<verse eid="JDG 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13"/>Bangʼ Elon, Abdon wuod Hillel, moa Pirathon, notelo ne Israel. <verse eid="JDG 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14"/>Ne en-gi yawuowi piero angʼwen kod nyikwayo ma yawuowi piero adek, mane nigi punde piero abiriyo ma giidho. Notelo ne Israel kuom higni aboro. <verse eid="JDG 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15"/>Eka Abdon wuod Hillel notho, kendo noyike Pirathon man Efraim, e piny got mar jo-Amalek.<verse eid="JDG 12:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nywol mar Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1"/>Jo-Israel nochako otimo timbe mamono e wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye, omiyo Jehova Nyasaye nochiwogi e lwet jo-Filistia kuom higni piero angʼwen.<verse eid="JDG 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2"/>Ja-Zora moro, ma nyinge Manoa, moa e anywola joka Dan, ne en gi dhako ma migumba kendo nobedo maonge nyathi. <verse eid="JDG 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3"/>Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nofwenyorene mi owacho niya, “In migumba kendo ionge nyathi to ibiro mako ich mi inywol wuowi. <verse eid="JDG 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4"/>Koro kik imadh divai kata gimoro amora mamero ji kendo kik icham chiemo moro amora mogak, <verse eid="JDG 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5"/>nikech ibiro mako ich kendo ininywol wuowi. Wembe ok nokal e wiye, nikech wuowino nyaka bed ja-Nazir, mowal ne Nyasaye, koa nywolne, kendo nochak reso jo-Israel oa e lwet jo-Filistia.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6"/>Eka dhakono nodhi ir chwore kendo owachone niya, “Ngʼat Nyasaye nobiro ira. Nochalo malaika mar Nyasaye, nolich ahinya. Ne ok apenje kuma ne oaye, kendo kata nyinge ne ok onyisa. <verse eid="JDG 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7"/>To nowachona ni, ‘Ibiro mako ich kendo ininywol wuowi. Omiyo koro, kik imadh divai kata gimoro amora mamero ji kendo kik icham chiemo moro amora mogak, nikech wuowino biro bedo ja-Nazir mar Nyasaye kochakore chiengʼ nywolne nyaka thone.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8"/>Eka Manoa nolamo Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Yaye Ruoth Nyasaye, akwayi, mad iwe ngʼat Nyasaye mane ioro irwa obi kendo opuonjwa kaka wanyalo rito wuowini.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9"/>Nyasaye nowinjo Manoa, kendo malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye noduogo ir dhako sa ma ne en e puodho; to Manoa chwore ne ok ni kode. <verse eid="JDG 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10"/>Chi Manoa nodhi piyo monyiso chwore niya, “Ngʼat mane obiro ira cha ni ka!”<verse eid="JDG 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11"/>Manoa no-aa malo moluwo bangʼ chiege. Kane ochopo ir ngʼatno, nowacho niya, “In e ngʼama nowuoyo kod chiega?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Nodwoke niya, “Ee, en an.”<verse eid="JDG 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12"/>Omiyo Manoa nopenje niya, “Ka wechegi ochopo kare, to chike mage mabiro rito ngima kod tich wuowini?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13"/>Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Chiegi nyaka tim gigo duto ma asenyise. <verse eid="JDG 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14"/>Ok onego ocham gimoro amora mowuok kuom mzabibu, kata madho divai moro amora kata madho gimoro amora mamero ji kata chamo chiemo moro amora mogak. Nyaka otim gik moko duto masechike.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15"/>Manoa nowachone malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Dwaher mondo ibed kodwa matin nyaka wayangʼnie nyadiel moro.”<verse eid="JDG 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16"/>Malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nowacho niya, “Kata bed ni ugengʼona kae, to ok anacham chiembu moro amora. To ka uiko misango miwangʼo pep, to uchiwe ne Jehova Nyasaye.” Manoa ne ok ongʼeyo nine en malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="JDG 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17"/>Eka Manoa nonono malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Nyingi ngʼa; mondo mi wabi wamiyi duongʼ ka wachni obedo adiera?”<verse eid="JDG 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18"/>Nodwoko niya, “Angʼo ma omiyo ipenjo nyinga? En nying modhiero ngʼeyo.” <verse eid="JDG 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19"/>Eka Manoa nokawo nyadiel, kaachiel gi chiwo mar cham, mi otimone Jehova Nyasaye misango ewi lwanda. Kendo Jehova Nyasaye notimo gima hono ka Manoa gi chiege neno. <verse eid="JDG 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20"/>E sa ma pilni mach ne dhwolore koa e kendo mar misango kochiko polo, malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye nodhi malo koluwo pilni mach. Kane gineno ma, Manoa gi chiege nopodho piny auma. <verse eid="JDG 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21"/>Kane malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye ne ok ochako ofwenyore ne Manoa gi chiege, Manoa nofwenyo ni ne en malaika mar Jehova Nyasaye.<verse eid="JDG 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22"/>Nowachone chiege niya, “Wabiro tho nikech waseneno Nyasaye gi wangʼwa!”<verse eid="JDG 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23"/>To chiege nodwoko niya, “Ka dipo ni Jehova Nyasaye ne nigi paro mar negowa, to dine ok oyie misango miwangʼo pep kod chiwo mar cham moa e lwetwa, kata nyisowa gigi duto kata nyisowa masani.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24"/>Dhakono nonywolo wuowi kendo nochake ni Samson. Nodongo kendo Jehova Nyasaye nogwedhe, <verse eid="JDG 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25"/>kendo Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nochako bedo kode ka en Mahane Dan, e kind Zora gi Eshtaol.<verse eid="JDG 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyombo mar Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1"/>Samson nodhi Timna kendo noneno nyako ma pod tin ma nyar jo-Filistia. <verse eid="JDG 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2"/>Kane odwogo to ne onyiso wuon-gi gi min-gi niya, “Aseneno nyar jo-Filistia modak Timna; omiyo koro kelnagouru obed chiega.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3"/>Wuon-gi gi min-gi nodwoke niya, “Donge nitiere nyako modimbore kuom wedeni kata kuom jowa duto? Ochuno ni nyaka idhi ir jo-Filistia ma ok oter nyangu mondo iyude dhako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">To Samson nowachone wuon-gi niya, “Miya gouru. En ema owinjore koda.” <verse eid="JDG 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4"/>Jonywolne ne ok ongʼeyo ni ma en dwaro Jehova Nyasaye, mondo omi giyud thuolo mar kedo gi jo-Filistia; nimar e kindeno jo-Israel ne ni e bwo lochgi.<verse eid="JDG 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5"/>Samson nodhi Timna kaachiel gi wuon-gi kod min-gi. Kane gichiegni chopo e puoth mzabibu mar Timna, apoya nono nyathi sibuor nowuok karuto kochome tir. <verse eid="JDG 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6"/>Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kuome giteko mane oyiecho sibuor koni gi koni gi lwete nono mana kaka onyalo yiecho nyadiel. To ne ok onyiso wuon mare kata min mare gima ne osetimo. <verse eid="JDG 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7"/>Eka nodhi mi owuoyo gi nyakono, kendo nohere.<verse eid="JDG 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8"/>Bangʼe achien, kane odhi mondo onywome, nolokore mondo one choke sibuor motho. E ringrene kanyo nopo koneno kich mochiek kochokore kuome, <verse eid="JDG 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9"/>mi nowuodho pet kiny motimo mo, mi nochamo kodhi. Kane oriwore gi jonywolne kendo, nomiyogi matin, kendo gin bende negichamo. To ne ok onyisogi nine ogolo mor kichno e choke sibuor motho.<verse eid="JDG 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10"/>Wuon-gi nodhi mondo one nyakono. Kendo Samson noloso nyasi kanyo, nikech mano ema ne en kit wuowi madwaro nyombo. <verse eid="JDG 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11"/>Kane ochopo, to ne omiye jochungʼ piero adek.<verse eid="JDG 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12"/>Samson nowachonegi niya, “We agonue ngero moro. Ka unyalo miya dwoko bangʼ ndalo abiriyo mar nyasini, to anamiu kandhe piero adek gi lewni mabeyo bende piero adek.” <verse eid="JDG 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13"/>Ka ok unyal miya dwoko, to nyaka umiya kandhe piero adek gi lewni mabeyo bende piero adek.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Negiwachone niya, “Nyiswa ngero mari mondo wawinji.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14"/>Nodwoko niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">“Gima ichamo nowuok kuom jocham ji;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:14">gima mit nowuok kuom ratego.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Kuom ndalo adek ne ok ginyal chiwo dwoko.<verse eid="JDG 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15"/>E odiechiengʼ mar angʼwen, neginyiso chi Samson niya, “Hoo chwori mondo onyiswa tiend ngerono, ka ok kamano, to wabiro wangʼi kaachiel gi od wuonu duto nyaka utho. Ne iluongowa kae mondo imawa?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16"/>Eka chi Samson nodirore kuome, koywak, “Ok idwara! Ok ihera. Isemiyo joga ngero, to pod ok inyisa tiende.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Samson nodwoke niya, Wachni pod ok anyiso wuonwa kata minwa, “angʼo momiyo nyaka anyisi tiende?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17"/>Noywak odiechienge abiriyo duto mar nyasi. Omiyo e odiechiengʼ mar abiriyo nonyise, nikech nosiko mana kokase. Bangʼe nonyiso joge tiend ngerono.<verse eid="JDG 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18"/>Kane chiengʼ pod ok opodho e odiechiengʼ mar abiriyo, jo-dalano nowachone niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“En angʼo mamit moloyo mor kich?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">En angʼo maratego moloyo sibuor?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Samson nowachonegi niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Kane ok upuro gi nyarocha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">to dine ok uyudo tiend ngeroni.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19"/>Eka Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kuome gi teko. Nodhi Ashkelon, monego ji piero adek ma omagi gigegi mi ochiwo kandhe ne jogo mane owacho tiend ngero. Nodhi e od wuon ka en gi mirima. <verse eid="JDG 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20"/>Chi Samson nomi osiepne mane jachungʼne kokendo.<verse eid="JDG 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Samson ochulo kuor ne jo-Filistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1"/>Bangʼ kinde moko e ndalo mar kayo ngano, Samson nokawo nyadiel kendo nodhi limo chiege. Nowacho niya, “Adhi od nindo mar chiega.” To jaduongʼne ne ok nyal yiene mondo odonji.<verse eid="JDG 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2"/>Nowachone niya, “Ne an-gi adieri ni ok idware, omiyo ne amiye osiepni. Donge nyamin mare matin ber neno moloye? En ema koro ikawe.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3"/>Samson nowachonegi niya, “Koro an-gi ratiro mar kedo gi jo-Filistia; ma kata koro atimonegi marach to aonge gi ketho.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4"/>Omiyo nowuok kendo nomako kibwe mia adek motweyogi gi iwgi ariyo ariyo. Bangʼe notweyo mach e yiw kibwego, <verse eid="JDG 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5"/>bangʼe nomako mach e yiw kibwego mi oweyogi mondo gidonj e puothe mag jo-Filistia. Nowangʼo puothe moseka to gi mago mapodi, kaachiel gi puoth mzabibu kod puothe zeituni.<verse eid="JDG 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6"/>Kane jo-Filistia openje niya, “En ngʼa motimo ma?” To nodwokgi niya, “En Samson, ma or ja-Timna, nikech chiege nomaye momi osiepne.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:6">Omiyo jo-Filistia nodhi mowangʼo dhakono gi wuon-gi mi githo. <verse eid="JDG 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7"/>Samson nowachonegi niya, “Nikech usetimo gima kama, ok analingʼ nyaka achulnu kuor.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8"/>Nomonjogi gi mirima ahinya mi onego ji mangʼeny kuomgi. Bangʼe nodhi modak e rogo mar lwanda man Etam.<verse eid="JDG 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9"/>Jo-Filistia nowuok kendo ne gibworo chakre dala mar Juda nyaka Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10"/>Jo-Juda nopenjogi niya, “Angʼo ma omiyo ubiro kedo kodwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Negidwokogi niya, “Wabiro mako Samson, mondo watimne kaka otimonwa.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11"/>Eka ji alufu adek moa Juda nodhi e rogo mar lwanda man Etam ma giwachone Samson niya, “Bende ingʼeyo ni wan e bwo loch jo-Filistia? Ma angʼo ma isetimonwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Nodwoko niya, “Ne atimonegi mana gima gisetimona.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12"/>Negiwachone niya, “Wasebiro mondo watweyi kendo wachiwi e lwet jo-Filistia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samson nowacho niya, “Kwongʼrenauru ni un uwegi ok ununega.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13"/>Negidwoke niya, “Wayie. Wabiro mana tweyi bangʼe wachiwi e lwetgi. Ok wananegi.” Omiyo ne gitweye gi tonde ariyo manyien ma gigole oko mar lwanda. <verse eid="JDG 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14"/>Kane ochiegni chopo Lehi, jo-Filistia nobiro kakok kochome. Roho mar Jehova Nyasaye nobiro kuome gi teko. Tonde mane otweyego nochalo ka usi mowangʼ, kendo gik mane otweyego nolwar oa e lwete. <verse eid="JDG 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15"/>Noyudo chogo manyien mar lemb punda, nokawe kendo nonego ji alufu achiel.<verse eid="JDG 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16"/>Eka Samson nowacho niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">“Gi chogo mar lemb punda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">aselokogi punde mangʼeny.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">Gi chok lemb punda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">asenego ji alufu achiel.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17"/>Kane osetieko wuoyo, nowito chok lemb punda; kendo kanyo nochaki ni Ramath Lehi.<verse eid="JDG 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18"/>Nikech riyo nohewe ahinya, noywak ne Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Isemiyo jatichni loch maduongʼ kama. Tangʼ atho gi riyo kendo alwar e lwet joma ok oter nyangu?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19"/>Eka Nyasaye noyawo holo e Lehi, kendo pi nowuok kanyo. Kane Samson omodhe, tekone noduogo. Omiyo thidhiano nochako ni En Hakore, kendo pod entiere Lehi.<verse eid="JDG 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20"/>Samson notelo ne Israel kuom higni piero ariyo e ndalo mag jo-Filistia.<verse eid="JDG 15:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Samson kod Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1"/>Chiengʼ moro achiel Samson nodhi Gaza, kama nonenoe nyako moro ma jachode mi odhi mondo oterre kode. <verse eid="JDG 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2"/>Nonyis jo-Gaza niya, “Samson nitiere kae!” Omiyo negilworo kanyo kendo gibuto ka girite otieno duto e dhoranga dala maduongʼ. Ne ok gisudo otienono, kagiwacho niya, “Kochopo kogwen to wabiro nege.”<verse eid="JDG 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3"/>To Samson nonindo kanyo nyaka dier otieno. Eka no-aa malo kendo nomako ranga dalano kaachiel gi sirnine ariyo mopudhogi kod gik moko duto. Notingʼogi e goke mi oterogi ewi got momanyore gi Hebron.<verse eid="JDG 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4"/>Bangʼ mano, nomako osiep hera gi nyako ma nyinge Delila e Holo mar Sorek. <verse eid="JDG 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5"/>Jotend jo-Filistia nodhi ir Delila mi owachone niya, “Tem ane ka inyalo hoye mondo onyisi kuma tekone ae kendo ingʼe kaka wanyalo loye mondo mi watweye kendo sande. Wabiro miyi fedha ma pekne romo kilo apar gadek ngʼato ka ngʼato.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6"/>Omiyo Delila nowachone Samson niya, “Nyisa ane kuma tekoni ae kendo kaka inyalo maki mi tweyi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7"/>Samson nodwoke niya, “Ka ngʼato otweya gi tonde abiriyo manyien mapok otiyo, to abiro bedo manyap machal gi ngʼato angʼata.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8"/>Eka jotelo mag jo-Filistia nokelone Delila tonde abiriyo manyien mapok otiyo, eka notweye gi tondego. <verse eid="JDG 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9"/>Kane osepando jomoko ei ot kanyo, noluonge kowacho niya, “Samson, jo-Filistia osebiro monji!” To ne ochodo tondego e yo mayot mana kaka tol chot kokete machiegni gi mach. Omiyo kuma tekone ae ne ok ofweny.<verse eid="JDG 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10"/>Eka Delila nowachone Samson niya, “Isekawa ngʼama ofuwo; ne iwuonda. Bi mondo koro inyisa kaka inyalo tweyi.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11"/>Nowachone niya, “Ka ngʼato otweya moridore gi tonde manyien mapok otiyo, to abiro bedo manyap machal gi ngʼato angʼata.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12"/>Omiyo Delila nokawo tonde manyien mi otweyego. Kane osepando jomoko ei ot kanyo, noluonge kowacho niya, “Samson, jo-Filistia osebiro monji!” To nochodo tondego mana ka gima gin usi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13"/>Eka Delila nowachone Samson niya, “Nyaka sani, isebedo ka ikawa ka ngʼama ofuwo kendo isewuonda. Nyisa kaka inyalo tweyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Nodwoko niya, “Ka ikado yie wiya gi usi mar chwecho kendo miride gi pino, to anabed manyap machal gi ngʼato angʼata.” Omiyo kane onindo Delila nokado yie wiye nyadibiriyo, kotwangʼe matek gi usi mar chwecho <verse eid="JDG 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14"/>kendo oride motegno gi pino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:14">Noluonge kendo niya, “Samson, jo-Filistia osebiro monji.” Nochiewo oa e nindo mi opudho pino oko kod usi mar chwecho.<verse eid="JDG 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15"/>Bangʼe nowachone niya, “Ere kaka inyalo wacho ni ihera to ok inyal nyisa kuma tekoni ae? Ma koro en mar adek ma iseketa ka ngʼama ofuwo kendo pod ok inyisa kuma tekoni ae.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16"/>Noromo Samson gi wachni pile ka pile manomiyo koro odwaro mana dere.<verse eid="JDG 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17"/>Omiyo nohulone gik moko duto kowachone niya, “Onge wembe mosekadho e wiya nikech asebedo ja-Nazir ma Nyasaye nowalo nyaka aa nywolna. Ka yie wiya oliel, to tekra biro rumo, kendo abiro bedo manyap machal gi ngʼato angʼata.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18"/>Ka Delila noneno nine osenyise gik moko duto, nooro wach ne jotend jo-Filistia niya, “Dwoguru dichiel; osenyisa gik moko duto.” Omiyo jotend jo-Filistia noduogo gi chudo e lwetgi. <verse eid="JDG 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19"/>Delila nohoyo Samson mi nonindo koteno wiye kuome, eka noluongo ngʼato mondo obi oliel yie wiye mane osekad nyadibiriyo. Bangʼ mano tekre norumo.<verse eid="JDG 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20"/>Eka noluonge niya, “Samson, jo-Filistia osebiro mondo omonji!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:20">Kane ochiewo to ne owacho e chunye niya, “Abiro wuok kaka pile mondo abed thuolo.” To ne ok ongʼeyo ni Jehova Nyasaye noseweye.<verse eid="JDG 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21"/>Bangʼe jo-Filistia nomake, mi gilodho wengene oko kendo ne gitere nyaka Gaza. Eka ne gitweye gi nyoroche mag mula, mi gikete jarego e od twech. <verse eid="JDG 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22"/>To bangʼe yie wiye nochako twi mos mos.<verse eid="JDG 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tho mar Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23"/>Koro jotend jo-Filistia nochokore mondo gitim misango maduongʼ ne Dagon ma nyasachgi, negitimo nyasi kagiwacho niya, “Nyasachwa osechiwo Samson ma jasikwa e lwetwa.”<verse eid="JDG 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24"/>Ka ji nonene, negipako nyasachgi, kagiwacho niya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">“Nyasachwa osechiwo jasikwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 16:24">e lwetwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">ngʼatno mane oketho pinywa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 16:24">mi omiyo onegwa mangʼeny.”<verse eid="JDG 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25"/>E seche mane gin-gi ilo mathothno, negigoyo koko niya, “Keluru Samson mondo omielnwa.” Omiyo negigolo Samson oko mar od twech, mi omielnegi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:25">Kane oyudo gichunge e kind sirni, <verse eid="JDG 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26"/>Samson nowachone jatich mane omako lwete niya, “Keta ane kama anyalo muloe sirni mosiro hekaluni, mondo omi ayiengra kuomgi.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27"/>Koro hekalu nopongʼ gi chwo kod mon; jotend jo-Filistia duto ne ni kanyo, kendo ne nitie chwo gi mon alufu adek mane ni ewi tado ka ngʼiyo Samson kamiel. <verse eid="JDG 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28"/>Eka Samson noywak ne Jehova Nyasaye niya, “Yaye Jehova Nyasaye Manyalo Gik Moko Duto, para! Yaye Nyasaye, duogna teko mana dichiel kende mondo achulgo kuor kuom jo-Filistia-gi kuom toko wengena ariyo oko.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29"/>Eka Samson nomako sirni ariyo mane ni e chuny hekalu mane osiro hekalu. Kosirogi moro ka moro, ka lwedo korachwich osiro achiel to lwedo koracham e machielo, <verse eid="JDG 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30"/>Samson nowacho niya, “Mad iyie atho gi jo-Filistia-gi!” Eka nodhiro sirnigo gi tekone duto, kendo hekalu norwombore piny kuom jotelo kod ji duto mane ni e iye. Omiyo nonego ji mangʼeny sa ma notho moloyo kane ongima.<verse eid="JDG 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31"/>Eka owetene kod joka wuon mare duto nodhi mondo okawe. Negikele ma gi hike e kind Zora gi Eshtaol e liend Manoa wuon mare. Notelo ne Israel kuom higni piero ariyo.<verse eid="JDG 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyiseche mopa mag Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1"/>Koro ne nitie ngʼat moro ma nyinge Mika mane oa e piny gode mar Efraim, <verse eid="JDG 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2"/>nowachone min mare niya, “Fedha ma pekne romo kilo apar gadek mane omayi kendo mane awinjo kikwongʼogo ngʼat mane okwale; an ema an kodgi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Eka min mare nowachone niya, “Wuoda, mad Jehova Nyasaye gwedhi!”<verse eid="JDG 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3"/>Kane odwokone min mare fedha ma pekne romo kilo apar gadekgo, min-gi nowachone niya, “Achiwo fedha maga duto ne Jehova Nyasaye mondo mi wuoda olosgo kido mopa mar nyasaye, omiyo koro aduogonigo.”<verse eid="JDG 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4"/>Omiyo nodwokone min mare fedha, kendo min-gi nokawo fedha ma pekne romo kilo ariyo gi nus mi ochiwogi ne jatheth, mane olosogi e kido mar nyasaye milamo. Kendo noketgi e od Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5"/>Koro ngʼatni ma nyinge ne Mika neni gikare mar lemo, kendo noloso law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod kod nyisechegi kendo noketo achiel kuom yawuote kaka jadolo. <verse eid="JDG 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6"/>E kindeno Israel ne onge ruoth; kendo ngʼato ka ngʼato ne timo kaka ohero.<verse eid="JDG 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7"/>Rawera ma ja-Lawi moa Bethlehem e piny Juda, mane osebedo kodak gi anywola jo-Juda, <verse eid="JDG 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8"/>nowuok Bethlehem mondo omany kama onyalo dakie. Kane pod odhi nyime gi wuoth, nodhi e od Mika mantiere e piny gode mag Efraim.<verse eid="JDG 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9"/>Mika nopenje niya, “Ia kanye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Nodwoke niya, “An ja-Lawi moa Bethlehem man Juda, kendo amanyo kama anyalo dakie.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10"/>Eka Mika nowachone niya, “Dag koda kendo ibed wuonwa kod jadolo, kendo abiro miyi fedha ma pekne romo robo mar kilo, gi lewni kod chiemo e higa.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11"/>Omiyo ja-Lawino noyie dak kode, kendo wuowino ne chalone mana kaka achiel kuom yawuote. <verse eid="JDG 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12"/>Eka Mika noketo ja-Lawino kendo wuowino nobedo jadolone kendo nodak e ode. <verse eid="JDG 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13"/>Kendo Mika nowacho niya, “Koro angʼeyo ni Jehova Nyasaye biro timona maber, nikech ja-Lawi osebedo jadolo mara.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Dan odak Laish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1"/>Ndalogo jo-Israel ne onge gi ruoth.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:1">Kendo e ndalogo joka Dan ne manyo kargi giwegi ma ginyalo dakie, nikech ne pod ok giyudo kar dak e dhout jo-Israel. <verse eid="JDG 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2"/>Omiyo jo-Dan nooro jolweny abich moa Zora gi Eshtaol mondo onon pinyno kendo ongʼe kaka pinyno chalo. Jogi nochungʼne dhout gigo duto. Negiwachonegi niya, “Dhiuru mondo unon pinyno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:2">Jogo nodonjo e piny gode mag Efraim kendo negidhi e od Mika, kama ne ginindoe. <verse eid="JDG 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3"/>Kane gichopo machiegni gi od Mika, ne giwinjo dwond ja-Lawi moro ma wuowi; omiyo negidonjo kanyo mi gipenje niya, “Ngʼama nokeli ka? Angʼo ma itimo ka? Angʼo ma omiyo in ka?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4"/>Nonyisogi gima Mika nosetimone, kendo owacho niya, “Osekawa kaka jatije kendo an jadolo mare.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5"/>Eka negiwachone niya, “Kiyie to penjnwa Nyasaye ka wuodhwa dhi bedo maber.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6"/>Jadolo nodwokogi niya, “Dhiuru gi kwe. Wuodhu osepwodhi gi Jehova Nyasaye.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7"/>Omiyo ji abichgo noa mi gichopo Laish, kama negineno ka ji odak kanyo gi kwe, mana kaka jo-Sidon, maonge paro moro amora kata kibaji kendo negidak gi kwe. To nikech pinygi ne ok ochando gimoro amora, ne gin joma omewo. Bende, negidak mochwolore gi jo-Sidon kendo ne gionge gi osiep gi ngʼato angʼata.<verse eid="JDG 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8"/>Kane gidwogo Zora kod Eshtaol, owetegi nopenjogi niya, “Ne uyudo gik moko chalo nade kuno?”<verse eid="JDG 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9"/>Negidwokogi niya, “Biuru mondo wamonjgi! Waseneno ka piny cha ber ahinya. Donge udhi timo gimoro? Kik udeki ma ok udhi kuno kendo ukaw pinyno. <verse eid="JDG 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10"/>Ka uchopo kuno, to unuyud jogo ma ok oikore ne lweny kendo gi piny malach ma Nyasaye oseketo e lwetu, piny maonge gima ochando kendo man-gi gik moko duto.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11"/>Eka ji mia auchiel moa e dhood joka Dan, mane oikore ne lweny, nowuok oa Zora kod Eshtaol. <verse eid="JDG 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12"/>Kane pod gidhi negiloso kambi but Kiriath Jearim manie piny Juda. Mano ema omiyo piny mantiere yo podho chiengʼ mar Kiriath Jearim pod iluongo ni Mahane Dan nyaka chil kawuono. <verse eid="JDG 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13"/>Kane gia kanyo negidhi e piny gode mag Efraim ma gichopo e od Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14"/>Eka chwo abich mane obiro nono piny Laish nowachone owetegi niya, “Bende ungʼeyo ni achiel kuom udigi nigi law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod, nyiseche moko manono, kod kido mobaw gi fedha mag nyiseche manono? Koro ungʼeyo gima onego utim.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15"/>Omiyo negidhi kanyo ma gidonjo e od ja-Lawi ma wuowi mane ni ka Mika kendo gimose. <verse eid="JDG 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16"/>Jolweny mia auchiel ma jo-Dan moikore ne lweny nochungʼ e dhorangach. <verse eid="JDG 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17"/>Ji abich mane osetimo nonro matut mar pinyno nodonjo ei ot mokawo kido mopa machalo gi law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod, gi nyiseche manono mag udi, kod mago mopa, ka jadolo kod jolweny mia auchiel to ochungʼ e dhorangach.<verse eid="JDG 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18"/>Kane jogi odhi e od Mika ma gikawo kido mopa, law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod, nyiseche manono mag udi kod nyiseche mopa, jadolo nowachonegi niya, “Angʼo mutimono?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19"/>Negidwoke niya, “Lingʼ thi! Kik iwach gimoro amora. Dhi kodwa, kendo ibed wuonwa kendo jadolowa. Donge ber ka itiyone anywola kod dhoot Israel kaka jadolo moloyo mana tiyone jood ngʼato achiel?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20"/>Bangʼe jadolo nobedo gi mor. Nokawo law mayom mar dolo miluongo ni efod, nyiseche manono mag udi kod kido mopa kendo nodhi gi jogo. <verse eid="JDG 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21"/>Negichako wuoth ma gia ka nyithindgi matindo gi jambgi kod gigegi otelo e nyimgi.<verse eid="JDG 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22"/>Kane gisedhi mochwolore gi od Mika, jogo mane odak machiegni gi Mika noluong kanyakla kendo negilawo jo-Dan. <verse eid="JDG 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23"/>Kane gigoyo koko bangʼ-gi, jo-Dan nolokore kendo owacho ne Mika niya, “En angʼo marach kodi momiyo ne ioro wach ne jowu mondo oked kodwa?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24"/>Nodwoko niya, “Ne ukawo nyiseche mane aloso, kod jadolo matiyona kendo mi uwuok. En angʼo kendo makoro an-go? Ere kaka unyalo penjo, ‘En angʼo marach kodi?’ ”<verse eid="JDG 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25"/>Jo-Dan nodwoko niya, “We dwokori kodwa, ka ok kamano, to joma igi wangʼ moingo tekregi biro monji, bangʼe in kod joodi ibiro negi.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26"/>Omiyo jo-Dan nodhi nyime gi wuoth, kendo ka Mika noneno ka tekregi pekne, nowuok mi odok dalane.<verse eid="JDG 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27"/>Bangʼe negikawo gigo mane Mika oseloso, kod jadolo mare, kendo negidhi Laish, mondo giked gi jogo man-gi kwe kendo maonge gi ikruok moro amora mar kedo. Negimonjogi gi lingangla kendo negiwangʼo dala maduongʼno gi mach. <verse eid="JDG 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28"/>Onge ngʼama ne nyalo resogi nikech negidak mochwolore gi Sidon kendo ne onge watgi moro amora kanyo. Dala maduongʼno ne nitie e holo man but Beth Rehob.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:28">Jo-Dan nochako gero dala maduongʼno kendo negidak kanyo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29"/>Negichako kanyo ni Dan bangʼ kwargi Dan, mane wuod Israel; kata obedo ni dala maduongʼno ne iluongo chon ni Laish. <verse eid="JDG 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30"/>Joka Dan nochungo kido manono kanyo mondo gilam, kendo negiketo Jonathan wuod Gershom, ma wuod Musa, kod yawuote obedo jodolo ne dhood joka Dan nyaka ne ochopo kinde mane oter pinyno e twech. <verse eid="JDG 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31"/>Negidhi nyime ka gitiyone nyiseche manono mane Mika oseloso, to kindegi duto od Nyasaye neni Shilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Ja-Lawi gi chotne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1"/>Ndalogo jo-Israel ne onge gi ruoth.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 19:1">Koro ja-Lawi mane odak e chuny piny e gode mag Efraim nokendo nyako moro moa Bethlehem e piny Juda. <verse eid="JDG 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2"/>Dhakono wuodhe ne ok ber, omiyo noweyo ngʼatno modok dalagi e od wuon mare Bethlehem e piny Juda. Bangʼ kane osebedo kuno kuom dweche angʼwen, <verse eid="JDG 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3"/>chwore nodhi ire mondo olombe gi wach oduogi. Ne en-gi jatichne kod punde ariyo. Notere nyaka e od wuon mare, kendo ka wuon mare nonene, norwake gi mor. <verse eid="JDG 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4"/>Jaduongʼne, ma wuon nyako, nosaye mondo omed limogi; omiyo nobedo kanyo kuom ndalo adek, kochiemo kendo kometho, kendo konindo kanyo.<verse eid="JDG 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5"/>Chiengʼ mar angʼwen ne gichiewo gokinyi ka giikore mar wuok, to jaduongʼne nowachone niya, “We iyud gimoro icham; eka idhi.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6"/>Omiyo ji ariyogo nobedo piny mochiemo kendo ometho. Bangʼe jaduongʼne nowachone niya, “Yie iri kawuono mondo iyud mor.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7"/>Kendo kane ngʼatno oa malo mondo odhi, jaduongʼne nosaye, omiyo nonindo kanyo otienono. <verse eid="JDG 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8"/>Chiengʼ mar abich gokinyi, kane ochungo mondo odhi, jaduongʼne nowachone niya, “Bed mamor. Rit nyaka odhiambo!” Omiyo ji ariyogo nochiemo kanyakla.<verse eid="JDG 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9"/>E kinde ma ngʼatno gi dhakono kod jatichne nowuok mondo odhiyo, jaduongʼne nowachonegi niya, “Sa koro ngʼeny, omiyo ninduru ka nikech piny oseyuso. Ninduru kendo ubed mamor eka kiny gokinyi uchiew mondo udog thuru.” <verse eid="JDG 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10"/>To nikech ne ok odwar nindo kanyo kendo, ngʼatno nowuok mi ochiko yo Jebus (tiende ni, Jerusalem), gi pundege ariyo kod dhako morono.<verse eid="JDG 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11"/>Kane gichopo machiegni gi Jebus e kinde mag angʼich welo, jatich nowachone ruodhe niya, “Bi, mondo waywe e dala maduongʼ mar Jebus kendo wanind kanyo.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12"/>Ruodhe nodwoke niya, “Ooyo. Ok wanadhi e dala maduongʼ mar jodak, ma joge ok jo-Israel. Wabiro dhi nyaka wachop Gibea.” <verse eid="JDG 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13"/>Nomedo owacho niya, “Bi, mondo watem ka wanyalo chopo Gibea kata Rama mondo wabuor wanindi e achiel kuom miergo.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14"/>Omiyo negidhi nyime giwuoth, kendo chiengʼ nopodho ka gichiegni chopo Gibea e piny Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15"/>Kane gichopo kanyo mondo gibuor, negidhi mi gibet e laru mar dala maduongʼ, to onge ngʼama norwakogi mondo giyud kar nindo.<verse eid="JDG 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16"/>Odhiambono jaduongʼ moro moa e piny gode mag Efraim, mane odak Gibea (joma nodak kanyo ne gin jo-Benjamin), nobiro kanyo koa tiyo e puothe. <verse eid="JDG 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17"/>Kane ongʼiyo moneno jawuoth e laru mar dala maduongʼ, jaduongʼno nopenje niya, “Ua kanye, to udhi kanye?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18"/>Nodwoko niya, “Waa Bethlehem e piny Juda ka wadhi e chuny piny manie piny gode mag Efraim kuma adakie. Asebedo Bethlehem e piny Juda kendo koro adok e od Jehova Nyasaye. Onge ngʼama oserwaka e ode. <verse eid="JDG 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19"/>Wan kaka wasumbinigi wan gi lum ma pundewa nyalo chamo kod makati gi divai moromowa; onge gima waremo.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20"/>Jaduongʼno nowachonegi niya, “Orwaku e oda. We amiu gimoro amora ma udwaro. To kik unind e laru mar dala maduongʼni.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21"/>Omiyo nodhi kode e ode mi opidho pundege. Bangʼ kane giselwoko tiendegi, nomigi gima ginyalo chamo kendo madho.<verse eid="JDG 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22"/>Kane pod gibedo gi mor e kindgi giwegi, jomoko ma timbegi mono mag dala maduongʼno nolworo odno. Negigoyo dhoot ka gikok ne jaduongʼ ma wuon odno niya, “Gol oko ngʼatno mane obiro e odi mondo waterre kode.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23"/>Wuon odno nowuok oko mi owachonegi niya, “Ooyo, osiepena, kik utim tim mamonono. Nimar ngʼatni en wendona, kik utim gima rachno. <verse eid="JDG 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24"/>Neuru, kawuru nyara ma pod ok ongʼeyo chwo, kod dhako moroni. Abiro golonugi oko sani mondo uterru kodgi; to ngʼatni to kik utimne gima rachno.”<verse eid="JDG 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25"/>To jogi nodagi winje. Omiyo ja-Lawino nogolo chiege momiyogi, kendo negiterore kode githuon otieno duto, to kane ochopo kogwen, to ne giweye mondo odhi. <verse eid="JDG 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26"/>Kane ochopo gokinyi, dhakono nodok e ot kama ruodhe ne oninde, mogore piny e wangʼ dhoot kendo nonindo kanyo nyaka chiengʼ ochako rieny.<verse eid="JDG 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27"/>Ka ruodhe nochiewo gokinyi kendo oyawo dhoot mondo mi owuog oko odhi nyime gi wuodhe, noyudo ka chiege onindo kanyo, kogore piny e nyim dhoot, ka lwetene oriere piny e kar dino cham. <verse eid="JDG 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28"/>Nowachone niya, “Aa malo; wadhi.” To ne onge dwoko. Bangʼe ngʼatni noyieye e pundene kendo ne giwuok mondo gidog.<verse eid="JDG 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29"/>Kane ochopo dala, nokawo pala mokengogo chiege, fuoni ka fuoni migepe apar gariyo mi oorogi e gwenge duto mag Israel. <verse eid="JDG 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30"/>Ngʼato angʼata mane oneno ma nowacho niya, “Gima chalo kama ne pok one kata timore, chakre ndalo mane jo-Israel oa Misri nyaka chil kawuono. Paruruane wachni kendo noneuru mondo unyiswa ane gima onego watim!”<verse eid="JDG 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Jo-Israel okedo gi jo-Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1"/>Eka jo-Israel duto chakre Dan nyaka Bersheba, kaachiel gi joma oa e piny jo-Gilead nowuok kaka oganda achiel ma gichokore Mizpa e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="JDG 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2"/>Jotend dhout Israel duto nokawo keregi e chokruok mar jo-Nyasaye, jolweny alufu mia angʼwen man-gi ligangla. <verse eid="JDG 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3"/>Jo-Benjamin nowinjo ni jo-Israel nosedhi nyaka Mizpa. Eka jo-Israel nowacho niya, “Nyiswane kaka gima lichni notimore.”<verse eid="JDG 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4"/>Omiyo ja-Lawino, ma chwor dhako mane onegi, nowacho niya, “Ne adhi Gibea man Benjamin kaachiel gi chiega mondo wabuor kanyo. <verse eid="JDG 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5"/>E otienono chwo ma Gibea noluwo bangʼa ma gilworo ot, ka gin giparo mar nega. Negiterore gi chiega githuon, mi otho. <verse eid="JDG 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6"/>Bangʼe ne akawo ringre chiegano, mi apogee matindo tindo kendo aoro lembe ne dhoudi duto mag Israel kaka girkeni, nikech jogi notimo tim machachni kendo mar anjawo e piny Israel. <verse eid="JDG 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7"/>Koro, un jo-Israel duto, wuouru kendo ungʼad bura e wachni.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8"/>Ji duto nochungʼ mowuoyo gi dwol achiel niya, “Onge ngʼato kuomwa ka mabiro dhi dala. Ooyo, onge kata ngʼato achiel kuomwa madok e ode. <verse eid="JDG 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9"/>To koro ma e gima wabiro timo ne Gibea: Wabiro kedo kodgi kaka ombulu owacho. <verse eid="JDG 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10"/>Wabiro kawo chwo apar kuom chwo mia achiel moa e dhout Israel, kendo chwo mia achiel kuom ji alufu achiel, kendo alufu achiel kuom ji alufu apar, mondo ochiwre ne konyo jolweny. Bangʼ, ka jolweny osechopo Gibea man Benjamin, ginyalo kedo kodgi kaluwore gi tim marach mane gisetimone Israel.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11"/>Omiyo jo-Israel nochokore kanyakla ma giriwore gibedo gimoro achiel ka gikedo gi dala maduongʼno.<verse eid="JDG 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12"/>Dhout Israel nooro ji e dhout Benjamin duto, kawacho niya, “Mano en tim marach manade mosetim e dieruni? <verse eid="JDG 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13"/>Koro chiwuru jo-Gibea ma timbegi monogo mondo mi waneg-gi kendo mondo wapwodh richoni e kind Israel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:13">To jo-Benjamin ne ok owinjo jowetegi ma jo-Israel. <verse eid="JDG 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14"/>Ne giwuok e miechgi kanyakla nyaka Gibea mondo giked gi jo-Israel. <verse eid="JDG 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15"/>Gisano sano jo-Benjamin nochoko joma nigi ligangla alufu piero ariyo gauchiel koa e miechgi, koriw gi joma oyier mia abiriyo modak Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16"/>To kuom jolwenygo duto mane oyier ne nitie ji mia abiriyo ma rochembe manyalo bayo orujre, ma moro ka moro ne nyalo bayo orujre ma goo yier wich ma ok obayo.<verse eid="JDG 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17"/>Jo-Israel, ka iweyo jo-Benjamin oko, ne nitiere gi jo-ligangla alufu mia angʼwen, giduto ne gin jokedo.<verse eid="JDG 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18"/>Jo-Israel nodhi nyaka Bethel kendo gimanyo wangʼ Nyasaye. Negiwacho niya, “En dhoot mane kuomwa mabiro dhi mokwongo mondo oked gi jo-Benjamin?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Jo-Juda biro dhi mokwongo.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19"/>Kinyne jo-Israel nowuok kendo ne gibworo but Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20"/>Jo-Israel nowuok mondo oked gi jo-Benjamin kendo negiriedo jolwenjgi mag kedo gi jo-Benjamin e piny Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21"/>Jo-Benjamin nowuok Gibea kendo neginego jo-Israel alufu piero ariyo gariyo e paw kedo odiechiengno. <verse eid="JDG 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22"/>To jo-Israel nojiwore kendgi giwegi kendo negichako giriedo jolwenjgi kaka negisetimo chiengʼ mokwongo. <verse eid="JDG 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23"/>Jo-Israel nodok moywak e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nyaka odhiambo, kendo negimanyo wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye. Negiwacho niya, “Bende wanyalo dhi kendo mondo waked gi jo-Benjamin, owetewa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Jehova Nyasaye nodwoko niya, “Dhi uked kodgi.”<verse eid="JDG 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24"/>Eka jo-Israel nosudo machiegni gi jo-Benjamin e odiechiengʼ mar ariyo. <verse eid="JDG 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25"/>E kindeno, ka jo-Benjamin noa Gibea mondo oked kodgi, negichako ginego kendo jo-Israel alufu apar gaboro, ma duto ne nigi ligangla.<verse eid="JDG 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26"/>Eka jo-Israel duto nodok Bethel, kendo negibet piny kanyo ka giywak e nyim Jehova Nyasaye. Ne giriyo kech ka gilemo chakre okinyi nyaka odhiambo kendo negichiwo misengini miwangʼo pep kod misengini mar lalruok ne Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="JDG 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27"/>Kendo jo-Israel nodwaro wangʼ Jehova Nyasaye. (E ndalogo Sandug Muma mar singruok mar Nyasaye ne ni kanyo, <verse eid="JDG 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28"/>ka Finehas wuod Eliazar, ma wuod Harun, ne jadolo mare.) Negipenjo niya, “Bende wanyalo kedo gi Benjamin ma owadwa, koso kik watim kamano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">Jehova Nyasaye nodwokogi niya, “Dhiuru kinyne anachiwgi e lwetu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29"/>Eka jo-Israel nopondo machiegni gi Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30"/>Negidhi mondo giked gi jo-Benjamin chiengʼ mar adek kendo negiriedo jolwenjgi Gibea mana kaka negisetimo mokwongo. <verse eid="JDG 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31"/>Kane jo-Benjamin nowuok mondo orom kodgi negiywayogi mabor gi dala maduongʼ. Negichako nego jo-Israel mana kaka negisetimo mokwongo, omiyo ji piero adek notho e pap kod e yore; ma achiel dhi Bethel, machielo to dhi Gibea.<verse eid="JDG 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32"/>Kane jo-Benjamin ne pod wacho niya, “Walogi kaka pile,” to jo-Israel ne wacho niya, “Wadoguru chien mondo wagolgi e dala maduongʼ ka wachiko kodgi wangʼ yore.”<verse eid="JDG 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33"/>Jo-Israel duto nowuok kuonde mane gipondoe moriedo jolwenjgi Baal Tamar, kendo jo-Israelgo nochako kedo koa yo podho chiengʼ mar Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34"/>Eka jo-Israel alufu apar man-gi lony kuom lweny nomonjo Gibea gi e yo ka nyimgi. Lwenygi ne tek ma jo-Benjamin ne ok ofwenyo ni masira biro tiekogi. <verse eid="JDG 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35"/>Jehova Nyasaye noloyo jo-Benjamin e nyim Israel kendo odiechiengno jo-Israel nonego jo-Benjamin alufu piero gabich gi mia achiel man-gi ligangla. <verse eid="JDG 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36"/>Omiyo jo-Benjamin nongʼeyo ni oloogi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Jo-Israel ne ringo e nyim jo-Benjamin mondo oywagi, nikech negingʼeyo ni jolwenjgi mane opondo but Gibea biro konyogi. <verse eid="JDG 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37"/>Jogo mane osebedo kopondo nodonjo Gibea apoya nono, ka gikere koni gi koni ma ginego ji duto mane ni e dala maduongʼno gi ligangla. <verse eid="JDG 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38"/>Jo-Israel ne osewinjore gi joma nopondo ni ka gineno iro madhwolore e dalano, <verse eid="JDG 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39"/>to gingʼe ni jo-Israel osechako lweny.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:39">Jo-Benjamin nosechako nego jo-Israel (madirom piero adek), kendo negiwacho niya, “Waseloyogi mana kaka ne waloyogi e lweny mokwongo.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40"/>To ka iro nochako dhwolore malo koa e dala maduongʼ, jo-Benjamin nolokore moneno ka iro madhwolore e dalano ochomo polo. <verse eid="JDG 20:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41"/>Eka jo-Israel nopor kuomgi, kendo luoro nomako jo-Benjamin matek, nikech negifwenyo ni masira osechopo kuomgi. <verse eid="JDG 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42"/>Omiyo negiringo gia e nyim jo-Israel ka gichiko yo thim, to ne ok ginyal tony ne lweny. Kendo jo-Israel mane oa e mier nonegogi kanyo. <verse eid="JDG 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43"/>Negilworo jo-Benjamin, ka gilawogi mi gimakogi e alwora duto man yo wuok chiengʼ mar Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44"/>Jo-Benjamin duto mane otho odiechiengno ne gin jolweny marahuma alufu apar gaboro. <verse eid="JDG 20:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45"/>Joma notony noringo kochomo lwanda Rimon, to jo-Israel nonego ji alufu abich kuomgi e yo. Negidhi nyime ka giluwo bangʼ jo-Benjamin nyaka Gidom ma ginego ji alufu ariyo mamoko.<verse eid="JDG 20:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46"/>Jo-Benjamin duto mane oneg odiechiengno ne gin jolweny marahuma alufu piero ariyo gabich. <verse eid="JDG 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47"/>To ji mia auchiel noringo mi gidhi e thim nyaka e lwanda mar Rimon, kama negidakie kuom dweche angʼwen. <verse eid="JDG 20:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48"/>Jo-Israel noduogo chien momonjo jo-Benjamin mane odongʼ, mi ginegogi duto kaachiel gi jamni kod gimoro amora mane giyudo. Mier duto mane gineno e nyimgi ne giwangʼo.<verse eid="JDG 20:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Onwangʼ mon ne jo-Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1"/>Jo-Israel nosekwongʼore e piny Mizpa niya, “Onge kata achiel kuomwa mabiro chiwo nyare mondo okendi gi ja-Benjamin.”<verse eid="JDG 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2"/>Ji nodhi Bethel, kama ne gibetie e nyim Nyasaye nyaka odhiambo, ka gitingʼo dwondgi kendo ka giywak malit. <verse eid="JDG 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3"/>Ne giywak niya, “Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, angʼo momiyo ma osetimore ne Israel? Angʼo ma omiyo dhoot achiel nyalo lal e Israel kawuono?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4"/>Kinyne gokinyi ji nogero kendo mar misango ma gichiwo misango miwangʼo pep kod misango mar lalruok.<verse eid="JDG 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5"/>Eka jo-Israel nopenjo niya, “En dhoot mane e kind dhout Israel duto mapok ochokore e nyim Jehova Nyasaye?” Nimar ne gisekwongʼore ni dhoot moro amora ma ok ochokore e piny Mizpa e nyim Jehova Nyasaye nyaka negi.<verse eid="JDG 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6"/>Koro jo-Israel ne nigi kuyo nikech owetegi, ma jo-Benjamin. Negiwacho niya, “Kawuononi dhood Israel achiel olal. <verse eid="JDG 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7"/>Ere kaka wanyalo miyo jogo modongʼ mon, nimar wasekwongʼore e nyim Jehova Nyasaye ni ok wanamigi nyiwa mondo gikendi?” <verse eid="JDG 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8"/>Eka negipenjo niya, “En dhoot Israel mane mane ok ochokore e piny Mizpa e nyim Jehova Nyasaye?” Negifwenyo ni onge ngʼama noa Jabesh Gilead manobiro mochokore e chokruokno. <verse eid="JDG 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9"/>Nimar kane gikwano ji, negiyudo ni onge ngʼama noa jo-Jabesh Gilead.<verse eid="JDG 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10"/>Eka chokruokno nomiyo jolweny alufu apar gariyo chik mondo gidhi Jabesh Gilead kendo gineg joma odak kanyo machwo, kaachiel gi mon gi nyithindo. <verse eid="JDG 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11"/>Negiwacho niya, “Ma e gima onego utim. Neg dichwo moro amora to gi nyako moro amora mosengʼeyo dichwo.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12"/>Kuom joma nodak Jabesh Gilead negiyudo nyiri mia angʼwen mapok ongʼeyo chwo kendo negiterogi e kambi mar Shilo man Kanaan.<verse eid="JDG 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13"/>Eka oganda mane ochokore duto nooro chiwo mar kwe ne jo-Benjamin e lwanda mar Rimon. <verse eid="JDG 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14"/>Omiyo jo-Benjamin noduogo e sechego kendo nomigi mond jo-Jabesh Gilead mane odongʼ. To mon-go ne ok nyal romogi duto.<verse eid="JDG 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15"/>Ji nokuyo nikech Jehova Nyasaye nomiyo dhood Benjamin olal e kind dhout Israel. <verse eid="JDG 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16"/>Kendo jodong ogandano nowacho niya, “Ka oseneg mond Benjamin, ere kaka wabiro miyo jogi mane otony mon?” <verse eid="JDG 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17"/>Negiwacho niya, “Jo-Benjamin mane otony nyaka bed gi nyithindo mabiro chamo mwandugi mondo omi dhood Israel kik tieki. <verse eid="JDG 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18"/>Ok wanyal miyogi nyiwa obed mondegi, nimar wan jo-Israel wasekwongʼore kama: ‘Okwongʼ ngʼatno mochiwo nyare mondo okend gi ja-Benjamin.’ <verse eid="JDG 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19"/>To neuru, nitiere nyasi mar higa ka higa mar Jehova Nyasaye e Shilo, man yo nyandwat mar Bethel, kod yo wuok chiengʼ mar yo madhi Shekem, kochomo yo milambo mar Lebona.”<verse eid="JDG 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20"/>Omiyo negimiyo jo-Benjamin chik, kagiwacho niya, “Dhiuru kendo upondi e puothe mzabibu <verse eid="JDG 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21"/>kendo uritane. Ka nyiri moa Shilo owuok oko mondo gibi e nyasi, to ringuru uwuogi mapiyo kua e puothe mzabibu mondo ngʼato ka ngʼato oyud dhako kuom nyirigo mondo udog-go e piny jo-Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22"/>Ka wuonegi kata owetegi obiro donjo irwa, to wabiro wachonegi ni, ‘Timnwa ngʼwono kuom konyogi, nikech ne ok wayudonegi mon e kinde mag lweny, kendo un uonge gi wach, nikech un ne ok umiyogi nyiu.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23"/>Omiyo mano e gima ne jo-Benjamin notimo. Ka nyirigo ne miel, ngʼato ka ngʼato nomako nyako achiel kuom nyirigo moloko chiege modhigo dala. Bangʼe negidwogo e lopgi mi gigero mier kanyo midakie.<verse eid="JDG 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24"/>E sechego jo-Israel nowuok kanyo ma gidok e miechgi kendo e dhoutgi ka ngʼato ka ngʼato dok e lope owuon.<verse eid="JDG 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25"/>E kindeno Israel ne onge ruoth; kendo ngʼato ka ngʼato ne timo kaka ohero.<verse eid="JDG 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21"/>
</usx>
